Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sauce sa non-technical pasa.

asr-001148
00:59:34.720 --> 00:59:36.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes po. Madam Speaker,

asr-001149
00:59:36.720 --> 00:59:38.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: dear colleague, pasensya na po.

asr-001150
00:59:38.720 --> 00:59:40.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Dear colleague, I cannot agree on the

asr-001151
00:59:40.720 --> 00:59:42.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: analogy doon sa tela.

asr-001152
00:59:42.720 --> 00:59:44.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi po ang tela, pag bumili

asr-001153
00:59:44.720 --> 00:59:46.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: tayo ng 2.5 meters na tela

asr-001154
00:59:46.720 --> 00:59:48.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: at ginawa natin barong, hindi

asr-001155
00:59:48.720 --> 00:59:50.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: nasa talaga 2.5 meters. Agree po ako

asr-001156
00:59:50.720 --> 00:59:52.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: doon. Pero ang magbabayad

asr-001157
00:59:52.720 --> 00:59:54.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: doon sa nawalang tela is mismo

asr-001158
00:59:54.720 --> 00:59:56.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: sino yung nagpagawa ng barong.

asr-001159
00:59:56.720 --> 00:59:58.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero yung system loss po kasi,

asr-001160
00:59:58.720 --> 01:00:00.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: iba po ito.

asr-001161
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:04.000
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang nangyayari, as sa tingin ko, the proper analogy of the system loss is,

asr-001162
01:00:04.320 --> 01:00:06.340
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: tayong lahat dito, kumain tayo sa restaurant.

asr-001163
01:00:07.760 --> 01:00:12.260
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Merong hindi nagbayad, pumuslit, so nanakawan.

asr-001164
01:00:12.840 --> 01:00:16.060
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang system loss, ang nangyayari, kung sino yung natira dito,

asr-001165
01:00:17.300 --> 01:00:22.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: sila yung maghahati-hating bayaran yung kinain nung hindi nagbayad sa restaurant.

asr-001166
01:00:22.580 --> 01:00:26.660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi ganun po yun, yung system loss, sinisingil doon sa mga nagbabayad,

asr-001167
01:00:26.780 --> 01:00:28.680
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi po sinisingil doon sa hindi nagbayad.

asr-001168
01:00:28.700 --> 01:00:29.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sa tumatakas.

asr-001169
01:00:29.400 --> 01:00:30.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, totally agree.

asr-001170
01:00:30.780 --> 01:00:38.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay, anyway, I will concentrate on the, all my questions will be about the non-technical system loss.

asr-001171
01:00:39.080 --> 01:00:43.540
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yung technical system loss, hindi naman po ako magaling sa technical, so hindi po ako magtatanong.

asr-001172
01:00:44.320 --> 01:00:50.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero yung non-technical system loss, pinakamalaki dyan ay tungkol doon sa pilferage, tama po ba?

asr-001173
01:00:50.580 --> 01:00:52.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001174
01:00:54.080 --> 01:00:56.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So kung pilferage yan, hindi...

asr-001175
01:00:57.920 --> 01:00:59.380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang isang malaking dahilan ng pilferage,

asr-001176
01:00:59.400 --> 01:01:03.800
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: is minsan kasi, for example, ang experience ko sa Meralco,

asr-001177
01:01:03.880 --> 01:01:06.260
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: I cannot speak about electrical cooperatives, no?

asr-001178
01:01:07.980 --> 01:01:10.480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Napipilitan, hindi ko naman tinotolerate,

asr-001179
01:01:11.220 --> 01:01:15.460
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: pero pag ang isang bahay, hindi nila kinabitan ng kuryente,

asr-001180
01:01:16.380 --> 01:01:19.700
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: dahil yung bahay na yun ay informal settler,

asr-001181
01:01:21.160 --> 01:01:24.920
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi naman mabubuhay yung tao na walang kuryente.

asr-001182
01:01:24.920 --> 01:01:25.020
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay.

asr-001183
01:01:25.920 --> 01:01:28.560
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So ang gagawin ng taong yun is,

asr-001184
01:01:29.400 --> 01:01:31.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: malamang magja-jumper.

asr-001185
01:01:32.060 --> 01:01:37.620
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: At yun ang magiging pilferage, at yun ang magiging system loss na sinisingil sa atin.

asr-001186
01:01:38.120 --> 01:01:40.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi dalawa lang yun, either bumili sa ilan ng submitter,

asr-001187
01:01:41.600 --> 01:01:42.760
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: siyempre mas mahal yun, di ba?

asr-001188
01:01:42.840 --> 01:01:44.360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Papatong yung may mother meter,

asr-001189
01:01:44.980 --> 01:01:47.200
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: o magja-jumper sila.

asr-001190
01:01:47.200 --> 01:01:51.820
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So hindi lang system loss ang problema dito, it's also a fire hazard, Madam Speaker.

asr-001191
01:01:53.220 --> 01:01:57.100
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ngayon, ang requirement kasi ng Meralco is,

asr-001192
01:01:57.100 --> 01:02:03.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: dapat mag-present ng titulo, o dapat may consent ng owner.

asr-001193
01:02:04.820 --> 01:02:08.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Siyempre, yung may-ari na privado,

asr-001194
01:02:09.400 --> 01:02:12.360
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi rin po siya papayag magbigay ng consent,

asr-001195
01:02:12.800 --> 01:02:17.100
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: kasi kadalasan, gusto nilang paalisin yung informal settler.

asr-001196
01:02:18.080 --> 01:02:21.260
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So para mapilitan pumalis yung informal settler,

asr-001197
01:02:21.260 --> 01:02:25.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: hindi nila bibigyan ng right of way, di ba?

asr-001198
01:02:25.900 --> 01:02:26.640
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: O ng authorization.

asr-001199
01:02:27.100 --> 01:02:34.240
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sa gobyerno, mas simple, kasi kami, sa Navotas, practical po kami.

asr-001200
01:02:34.960 --> 01:02:39.780
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag government land po yan, binibigyan namin ng authority na makapagkabit.

asr-001201
01:02:40.600 --> 01:02:43.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Dahil alam namin na hindi sila mabubuhay ng walang kuryente,

asr-001202
01:02:43.720 --> 01:02:46.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: at magiging fire hazard kung magja-jumper sila.

asr-001203
01:02:47.920 --> 01:02:52.680
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So ngayon, ang proposal ko noon, noon pong budget briefing,

asr-001204
01:02:53.060 --> 01:02:56.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: sabi ko, dapat baguhin ng ERC yung requirement.

asr-001205
01:02:57.100 --> 01:03:04.680
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Huwag na nilang hingan ng right of way o authority nung private land owner po,

asr-001206
01:03:04.840 --> 01:03:07.160
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: kasi hindi naman magbibigay yung private land owner.

asr-001207
01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:13.560
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: But yung pagbigay naman ng kuryente, kasi madam speaker, dear colleague,

asr-001208
01:03:13.900 --> 01:03:15.080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: sana po maintindihan nyo, di ba?

asr-001209
01:03:15.160 --> 01:03:18.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag may informal settler, madalas nag-aaway yung informal settler,

asr-001210
01:03:18.820 --> 01:03:19.860
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: tsaka yung may-ari ng lupa.

asr-001211
01:03:20.260 --> 01:03:26.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So natural, hindi magbibigay ng authority o ng consent yung may-ari ng lupa.

asr-001212
01:03:27.100 --> 01:03:39.380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So ang sabi ko noon, hindi ba dapat ang gawin ng ERC dyan is huwag na i-require yung titulo,

asr-001213
01:03:40.100 --> 01:03:45.120
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: huwag na i-require yung consent para lahat makabitan.

asr-001214
01:03:45.620 --> 01:03:49.420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag lahat kinakabitan, wala na silang dahilan kung bakit sila nagja-jumper.

asr-001215
01:03:49.840 --> 01:03:52.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yun po ang tanong ko po, madam speaker, dear colleague.

asr-001216
01:03:52.940 --> 01:03:55.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, madam speaker, that's a very good observation.

asr-001217
01:03:56.300 --> 01:03:57.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And I'm happy.

asr-001218
01:03:57.100 --> 01:04:03.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I'm happy to tell our good colleague that in amend na po yung ERC,

asr-001219
01:04:03.420 --> 01:04:06.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang magna-karta, September 10, pinadali na po ito.

asr-001220
01:04:07.080 --> 01:04:08.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So hindi na po kailangan ng titulo.

asr-001221
01:04:09.020 --> 01:04:11.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang kailangan nila po, kahit certification po ng barangay captain,

asr-001222
01:04:12.140 --> 01:04:15.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na ikaw po talagang taga dyan, residente dyan.

asr-001223
01:04:15.660 --> 01:04:20.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So yun na po yung pinapasunod ng anti-ERC sa mga de-use natin po.

asr-001224
01:04:21.380 --> 01:04:23.800
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So September 10, 2026 po naging effective.

asr-001225
01:04:23.820 --> 01:04:25.500
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ito po, September 10 pa lang po.

asr-001226
01:04:25.500 --> 01:04:26.260
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So salamat po.

asr-001227
01:04:27.100 --> 01:04:30.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Anong sa committee ay nagawa na po ng formal na aksyon?

asr-001228
01:04:30.780 --> 01:04:31.020
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes.

asr-001229
01:04:31.120 --> 01:04:31.240
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay.

asr-001230
01:04:31.860 --> 01:04:33.540
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang sunod ko pong tanong is,

asr-001231
01:04:34.620 --> 01:04:37.820
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: pag ang isang bahay, nahulihan na nag-jumper,

asr-001232
01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:40.760
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: dinidemanda po yan ng Meralco, tama?

asr-001233
01:04:41.640 --> 01:04:42.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, they should.

asr-001234
01:04:42.600 --> 01:04:42.840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay.

asr-001235
01:04:43.740 --> 01:04:50.200
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang gagamitin ng Meralco na computation doon sa sisingilin nila

asr-001236
01:04:50.200 --> 01:04:52.340
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: is titignan lahat ng appliances,

asr-001237
01:04:53.280 --> 01:04:56.920
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: tapos ikukumpute yun, yun ang sisingilin doon sa nag-jumper.

asr-001238
01:04:57.100 --> 01:05:00.860
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero, Madam Speaker, Dear Colleague,

asr-001239
01:05:03.040 --> 01:05:10.140
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: itong sinisingil nila doon sa nag-jumper ay nasingil na rin nila as system loss.

asr-001240
01:05:10.800 --> 01:05:12.140
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So hindi ba doble singil yun?

asr-001241
01:05:12.660 --> 01:05:16.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag nakolektahan nila yung nag-jumper,

asr-001242
01:05:19.760 --> 01:05:25.900
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: papaanong ino-audit ng ERC na i-bawas yun naman doon sa siningil as system loss?

asr-001243
01:05:25.900 --> 01:05:26.900
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ay, liliwanagin.

asr-001244
01:05:27.100 --> 01:05:28.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: I-bawas yun po ulit, di ba, Madam Speaker?

asr-001245
01:05:29.080 --> 01:05:31.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Are you talking about the pilferage recovery loss?

asr-001246
01:05:31.740 --> 01:05:32.220
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Hindi, di ba po?

asr-001247
01:05:33.880 --> 01:05:41.040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yung lahat ng total ng pilferage, yun po ang non-technical system loss.

asr-001248
01:05:41.660 --> 01:05:47.520
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, total yan, yun po ang i-charge sa mga consumers na system loss.

asr-001249
01:05:47.660 --> 01:05:48.660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pero may cap, di ba?

asr-001250
01:05:49.040 --> 01:05:49.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes.

asr-001251
01:05:49.280 --> 01:05:49.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: May cap.

asr-001252
01:05:50.540 --> 01:05:55.080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, portion of that, na-recover din nung utility.

asr-001253
01:05:55.080 --> 01:05:56.240
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Tama po.

asr-001254
01:05:57.100 --> 01:05:58.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes.

asr-001255
01:05:58.840 --> 01:06:01.020
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Portion na-recover niya as system loss.

asr-001256
01:06:02.100 --> 01:06:09.300
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ngayon, dinimanda po niya yung, at nahulihan nila ng jumper.

asr-001257
01:06:10.960 --> 01:06:16.760
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kung nagbayad po yung dinimanda nila, naka-recover din sila ng pera.

asr-001258
01:06:16.760 --> 01:06:26.080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, papaanong ina-account at minomonitor ng ERC na yung nakolekta ng system loss ay binawas?

asr-001260
01:06:27.100 --> 01:06:27.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Doon.

asr-001261
01:06:27.680 --> 01:06:29.620
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi otherwise, magiging doble bayad yan.

asr-001262
01:06:31.280 --> 01:06:31.540
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yes.

asr-001263
01:06:32.000 --> 01:06:35.380
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, dapat doon sa susunod na system loss, make a credit.

asr-001264
01:06:35.500 --> 01:06:38.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: For example, for example lang, para lang magbigay tayo ng figure.

asr-001265
01:06:38.860 --> 01:06:40.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: For example, may nawalang kuryente.

asr-001266
01:06:41.440 --> 01:06:46.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Nakasigil yung ERC ng, nakasigil yung electric utility ng limang piso.

asr-001267
01:06:47.320 --> 01:06:48.040
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Limang piso.

asr-001268
01:06:48.920 --> 01:06:50.740
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Dahil 5% ang cap, di ba?

asr-001269
01:06:50.860 --> 01:06:53.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: For example, limang piso nakolekta dahil 5% yung cap.

asr-001270
01:06:54.180 --> 01:06:55.340
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Later on,

asr-001271
01:06:55.980 --> 01:06:56.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: kinumpute nila,

asr-001272
01:06:57.100 --> 01:07:03.480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: later on po, kinumpute nila yung sisingilin doon sa nag-jumper.

asr-001273
01:07:04.340 --> 01:07:07.000
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: At ang nakumpute nilang sisingilin ay 100 piso.

asr-001274
01:07:08.820 --> 01:07:12.460
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pag hindi nila binawas yung limang pisong unang nakolekta,

asr-001275
01:07:13.300 --> 01:07:19.000
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: ibig sabihin, 105 ang total na nakolekta nila instead of 100 pesos.

asr-001276
01:07:19.660 --> 01:07:21.100
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So, yung system loss na nakolekta,

asr-001277
01:07:22.180 --> 01:07:25.960
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: papaano namang ibabawas, paano sinisigurado ng ERC

asr-001278
01:07:25.960 --> 01:07:30.500
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: na ibabawas naman doon sa system loss na kukolektahin sa susunod

asr-001279
01:07:30.500 --> 01:07:32.480
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: noong electrical utility?

asr-001280
01:07:32.720 --> 01:07:32.980
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Yun po.

asr-001281
01:07:33.380 --> 01:07:35.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, may formula po yan, Madam Speaker,

asr-001282
01:07:36.440 --> 01:07:38.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: regarding the rebate.

asr-001283
01:07:38.640 --> 01:07:40.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pag parang nag-overcharge,

asr-001284
01:07:40.980 --> 01:07:42.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kailangan po ibalik sa ating consumer.

asr-001285
01:07:43.380 --> 01:07:45.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang ginagamit po ng ERC,

asr-001286
01:07:45.260 --> 01:07:49.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sa pagkakulit yung generation charge,

asr-001287
01:07:49.880 --> 01:07:52.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: less the pilferage recovery

asr-001288
01:07:52.100 --> 01:07:53.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na monthly po,

asr-001289
01:07:53.600 --> 01:07:55.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nagsasubmit ang lahat ng mga distribution,

asr-001290
01:07:55.960 --> 01:07:58.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: utility ng report sa ERC.

asr-001291
01:07:58.980 --> 01:07:59.620
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Okay.

asr-001292
01:08:00.360 --> 01:08:03.560
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Panguling tanong na lang po, Madam Speaker, dear colleague.

asr-001293
01:08:06.180 --> 01:08:09.420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Pwede po bang magbigay ng assurance ang ERC

asr-001294
01:08:09.420 --> 01:08:13.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: na bago magkarood ng rate increase sa kuryente,

asr-001295
01:08:14.680 --> 01:08:19.440
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: ay maresolva muna yung system loss ng non-technical?

asr-001296
01:08:19.800 --> 01:08:22.520
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi po, ang hirap tanggapin ng consumer, di ba?

asr-001297
01:08:22.980 --> 01:08:25.580
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Nangako ang Pangulo na tatanggalin yung system loss.

asr-001298
01:08:25.960 --> 01:08:27.740
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Hindi pa natatanggal yung system loss.

asr-001299
01:08:27.840 --> 01:08:29.080
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Tataasan na natin ng kuryente,

asr-001300
01:08:29.280 --> 01:08:30.960
