01:14:15.580 --> 01:14:17.540
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: light regarding these matters, and I'm

asr-001479
01:14:17.540 --> 01:14:19.520
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: very satisfied with your answers.

asr-001480
01:14:20.020 --> 01:14:21.020
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: And yung ERC po,

asr-001481
01:14:21.640 --> 01:14:23.660
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: dahil po yung request ko na huwag nang hingan

asr-001482
01:14:23.660 --> 01:14:25.680
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: ng titulo, yung mga

asr-001483
01:14:25.680 --> 01:14:27.220
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: magpapakabit ng kuryente,

asr-001484
01:14:27.640 --> 01:14:29.720
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: whether private po yan

asr-001485
01:14:29.720 --> 01:14:31.560
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: or government lot,

asr-001486
01:14:32.160 --> 01:14:33.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: because of that,

asr-001487
01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:35.900
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: because of your quick action, na pagkatapos

asr-001488
01:14:35.900 --> 01:14:37.780
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: po nung budget briefing,

asr-001489
01:14:37.920 --> 01:14:39.560
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: e gumawa po kayo kaagad na resolusyon.

asr-001490
01:14:39.920 --> 01:14:41.700
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Therefore, I support the budget of

asr-001491
01:14:41.700 --> 01:14:43.060
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: the ERC. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001492
01:14:43.120 --> 01:14:44.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Congressman Toby Chanko.

asr-001492-split-2
01:14:44.540 --> 01:14:45.740
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you very much, Congressman

asr-001493
01:14:45.740 --> 01:14:47.920
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Toby Chanko. Majority Leader?

asr-001494
01:14:48.100 --> 01:14:49.980
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, may we recognize

asr-001495
01:14:49.980 --> 01:14:51.700
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Representative Elago for her

asr-001496
01:14:51.700 --> 01:14:52.420
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: interpellation.

asr-001497
01:14:53.660 --> 01:14:55.820
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Honorable Elago is recognized for interpellation.

asr-001498
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

asr-001499
01:15:03.320 --> 01:15:12.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilang dagdag na katanungan na lang na paglilinaw dahil po napakayaman na ng naging talakayan ng ating mga naunang interpellators.

asr-001500
01:15:13.140 --> 01:15:21.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, nabanggit kanina ng ating sponsor ang tungkol sa pending application ng Meralco para sa rate reset,

asr-001501
01:15:21.320 --> 01:15:34.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung saan humihingi sila ng approval para sa revenue requirement na humigit kumulang P532.13 billion na sisingilin sa mga consumer mula taong 2027 hanggang 2030.

asr-001502
01:15:35.360 --> 01:15:46.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para sa 2027, ang proposed maximum average price ng Meralco ay nasa P2.3436 per kilowatt hour mula sa P1.35 per kilowatt hour.

asr-001503
01:15:46.800 --> 01:15:49.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit din po kanina ang update dito ay,

asr-001504
01:15:49.820 --> 01:15:57.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bago magtapos ang taong 2026 ay magkakaroon na ng formal na desisyon dito ang ERC.

asr-001505
01:15:57.900 --> 01:16:05.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit Madam Speaker, noong February 2026, sa mga pahayag ng ERC,

asr-001506
01:16:06.140 --> 01:16:14.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: balak po nila o yung target sana nila na matapos ito, magkaroon ng formal na desisyon, ay nasa August to September this year.

asr-001507
01:16:14.680 --> 01:16:18.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang malaman kung ano yung mga dahilan?

asr-001508
01:16:18.960 --> 01:16:19.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung bakit po?

asr-001509
01:16:20.560 --> 01:16:28.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, sinasabi na natin na hindi na kaya ng August-September ang formal desisyon at mga nga ilangan pa ng mas mahabang oras ang ERC,

asr-001510
01:16:28.940 --> 01:16:33.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bagamat ang target ninyo ay matapos na ito bago ang taong 2026.

asr-001511
01:16:37.060 --> 01:16:40.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil po malaki yung application, marami pong CAPEX application,

asr-001512
01:16:42.840 --> 01:16:47.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: at saka yung mga assets yung po ng Meralco na nirefile,

asr-001513
01:16:47.100 --> 01:16:55.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: so we need to verify, we have to be very prudent also, we have to follow the process.

asr-001514
01:16:57.340 --> 01:17:02.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But the process usually 18 months, but now sinorten natin na into 8 months.

asr-001515
01:17:03.300 --> 01:17:08.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So ganun po yung mga reforma na ginawa po ng ERC.

asr-001516
01:17:08.520 --> 01:17:14.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kaya kung makikita niya po yung mga desisyon ng ERC, simula po na umupo ang ating pong chairman,

asr-001517
01:17:15.320 --> 01:17:16.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: comparing to the...

asr-001518
01:17:17.100 --> 01:17:22.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In the past, marami na pong nagawa, pero kulang, kulang pa.

asr-001519
01:17:22.960 --> 01:17:24.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kailangan ng tulong, kailangan po ng tulong.

asr-001520
01:17:25.320 --> 01:17:29.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kailangan ng additional budget, sobrang kailangan po ng additional budget.

asr-001521
01:17:30.420 --> 01:17:38.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, at tungkol naman din sa isa, sa mga sinisingil at pinapasa ng mga consumer,

asr-001522
01:17:38.000 --> 01:17:47.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay tungkol sa naaprubahan nitong August 2026 na provisional increase ng feed and tariff allowance.

asr-001523
01:17:47.100 --> 01:17:57.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O ng fit all, mula 0.2011 peso tungo sa 0.3359 per kilowatt hour, o 67% na increase.

asr-001524
01:17:58.260 --> 01:18:08.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil ayon sa kanila, sa liquidity problem ng fit all fund, para sa isang household na gumagamit ng 200 kilowatt hour kada buwan,

asr-001525
01:18:09.520 --> 01:18:15.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ito po ay nasa humigit kumulang, 67.18 pesos sa kanilang mga bela.

asr-001526
01:18:15.480 --> 01:18:16.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang original application...

asr-001527
01:18:17.100 --> 01:18:22.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang original application ng Transco ay nasa 0.2154 lamang per kilowatt hour,

asr-001528
01:18:22.460 --> 01:18:29.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero ang provisional rate na naaprubahan ng ERC ay nasa 0.3359 per kilowatt hour.

asr-001529
01:18:30.200 --> 01:18:35.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay mas mataas, mas malaki, kaysa dun sa hiningi mismo ng Transco.

asr-001530
01:18:36.040 --> 01:18:42.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano ba ang naging batayan para maging 0.3359 ang provisional rate na naaprubahan ng ERC?

asr-001531
01:18:42.720 --> 01:18:42.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

asr-001532
01:18:42.960 --> 01:18:56.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: From the original, Madam Speaker, may hiningi silang additional, kasi may shortfall na nga po na nakita sa fit all fund.

asr-001533
01:18:57.620 --> 01:19:01.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And this also to help, lalo ng ating pong mga REs.

asr-001534
01:19:01.720 --> 01:19:10.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But ito po yung talagang reason, fit all collection was suspended December 2022 until January 2024.

asr-001535
01:19:11.840 --> 01:19:12.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Delays in the...

asr-001536
01:19:12.960 --> 01:19:16.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Approval of fit all to update the rates when it resumed collection.

asr-001537
01:19:18.320 --> 01:19:23.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 2024, fit all was only approved March 2024.

asr-001538
01:19:24.740 --> 01:19:29.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And 2025, fit all was only approved November 2025.

asr-001539
01:19:30.960 --> 01:19:36.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As of August, 356 million of payable outstanding.

asr-001540
01:19:37.020 --> 01:19:41.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: By December, this will be fully paid, Madam Speaker.

asr-001541
01:19:42.320 --> 01:19:42.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

asr-001542
01:19:42.960 --> 01:19:48.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, hingi na lang po natin yung detalye ng mga bilang, lalo-lalo na.

asr-001543
01:19:48.480 --> 01:19:53.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Marami po talagang delay yung mga action dati, so ngayon po talaga nag-ahabol po tayo.

asr-001544
01:19:54.000 --> 01:20:00.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pero maganda lang pong ginawa, instead of yung backlog yung ayusin, ayusin mo po na natin yung now.

asr-001545
01:20:01.120 --> 01:20:04.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pag natapos po yung ngayon, balikan po natin yung mga backlogs po natin.

asr-001546
01:20:05.300 --> 01:20:11.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang buong fit all collections, ang ulat dito ay hinihingi ng representasyon na ito mula po sa ERC.

asr-001547
01:20:11.760 --> 01:20:12.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we will...

asr-001548
01:20:12.800 --> 01:20:14.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Submit, Madam Speaker.

asr-001549
01:20:14.840 --> 01:20:18.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ganoon din po, nababahala tayo dahil ang bumapasan nito ay mga consumer.

asr-001550
01:20:19.460 --> 01:20:27.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya kumbaga, sa ngayon ba pinag-aaralan po ng ERC, yung posible na pagtatanggal nito?

asr-001551
01:20:27.960 --> 01:20:34.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pagtatanggal nito sa pasanin ng mga consumer at paghahanap ng iba pong source ng funding?

asr-001552
01:20:34.840 --> 01:20:35.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, truly agree.

asr-001553
01:20:36.360 --> 01:20:38.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's why we do the reset.

asr-001554
01:20:38.680 --> 01:20:40.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We really need to do the reset.

asr-001555
01:20:40.240 --> 01:20:42.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's a means of...

asr-001556
01:20:42.160 --> 01:20:44.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: accountability and even transparency.

asr-001557
01:20:45.460 --> 01:20:48.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Lalo na sa pag-apply po ng rates na po nagsimulayan sa CAPEX.

asr-001558
01:20:49.260 --> 01:20:53.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, yan nga po, inabutan lang po tayo ng circumstance ng ganito.

asr-001559
01:20:54.060 --> 01:20:58.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, hindi po magandang rason na dahil po marami pong backlog noon.

asr-001560
01:20:58.780 --> 01:21:01.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But you can see, ERC is working on it already.

asr-001561
01:21:02.600 --> 01:21:07.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa katunayan, Madam Speaker, nitong July 2026,

asr-001562
01:21:07.080 --> 01:21:11.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: naghahain ang representasyon na ito ng isang panukalang resolusyon.

asr-001563
01:21:11.120 --> 01:21:14.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito ang pilang 1189.

asr-001564
01:21:14.940 --> 01:21:22.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang panawagan nga po natin ay maimbestigahan, makita, kung ano ba yung status ng collection,

asr-001565
01:21:23.720 --> 01:21:31.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kumusta ba yung pinagkakagastusan, at ano-ano ba yung iba't-ibang mga fees na sinisingil,

asr-001566
01:21:31.340 --> 01:21:38.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na pinapasan ng ating mga consumer dahil sa mga ulat, halimbawa po ng overbilling,

asr-001567
01:21:38.040 --> 01:21:41.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga hindi tama na meter readings,

asr-001568
01:21:41.120 --> 01:21:47.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ganun din po ang sobrang-sobrang taas na na singilin sa kuryente.

asr-001569
01:21:47.560 --> 01:21:54.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi pa po ito nasisimulan na matalakay dito sa Kongreso at hanggang natin na matalakay na agad

asr-001570
01:21:54.100 --> 01:22:01.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para mabusisi natin yung haba ng listahan ng mga pinapasan at binabalikat ng ating mga consumer.

asr-001571
01:22:01.340 --> 01:22:02.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Saan ba talaga napupunta?

asr-001572
01:22:03.000 --> 01:22:08.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung paano pa natin ito mababawasan, paano natin matitiyak ang murang kuryente,

asr-001573
01:22:08.540 --> 01:22:09.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang tunay na murang kuryente.

asr-001574
01:22:10.040 --> 01:22:10.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon ho,

asr-001575
01:22:11.120 --> 01:22:14.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol doon sa mga nabanggit ko ng mga reports,

asr-001576
01:22:16.100 --> 01:22:23.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may sinumiti na status of consumer complaints report ang ERC sa ating pong representasyon

asr-001577
01:22:23.780 --> 01:22:27.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sinabi nila na mula 2001 hanggang 2026,

asr-001578
01:22:28.400 --> 01:22:36.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: umabot ng 3,093 ang complaints na nasa decided, closed, at terminated category.

asr-001579
01:22:36.360 --> 01:22:40.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 81% ng mga total complaints na matanggap ng ERC.

asr-001580
01:22:41.120 --> 01:22:45.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nasabi nga po na decided, closed, at terminated na.

asr-001581
01:22:46.540 --> 01:22:51.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba natin malaman kung ano ang mga considerations na sineset ng ERC

asr-001582
01:22:51.360 --> 01:22:55.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para masabi na closed, at terminated na ang isang complaint?

asr-001583
01:22:56.060 --> 01:23:00.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: On the average, gano po ba katagal ang inaabot ng isang complaint

asr-001584
01:23:00.400 --> 01:23:03.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para mapagdesisyonan na closed at terminated na ito?

asr-001585
01:23:03.900 --> 01:23:05.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, marami pong factors yan.

asr-001586
01:23:06.420 --> 01:23:09.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Depende po yan sa complaint.

asr-001587
01:23:10.460 --> 01:23:11.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sa complainant.

asr-001588
01:23:11.120 --> 01:23:16.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kung na-settle ba po ba yung kanyang complaint, yung kanyang issues.

asr-001589
01:23:18.120 --> 01:23:25.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nagkaroon ba ng recalculation doon sa differential billing or disputed billing?

asr-001590
01:23:26.360 --> 01:23:30.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, marami pong factors, Madam Speaker, hindi lang po yung isa.

asr-001591
01:23:32.080 --> 01:23:33.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-001592
01:23:33.560 --> 01:23:40.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nakalatag din sa submission ng ERC na minumungkahin nila ang iba't ibang measures para ma-expedite

asr-001593
01:23:41.120 --> 01:23:43.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang resolution ng mga consumer complaints.

asr-001594
01:23:44.420 --> 01:23:48.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Saan po naibase ng ERC ang mga mungkahe sa prosesong ito?

asr-001595
01:23:49.080 --> 01:23:54.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nagkaroon po ba ng assessment, consultation, kasama ang mga distribution utilities, consumer,

asr-001596
01:23:54.940 --> 01:24:01.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa paghahandle ng mga complaints bago buuin ang mga recommended measures na ito?

asr-001597
01:24:01.700 --> 01:24:10.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Basically, hindi po kailangan niyong magkaroon ng consultation.

asr-001598
01:24:11.120 --> 01:24:13.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Trabaho po mismo ng ERC na mag-regulate.

asr-001599
01:24:14.060 --> 01:24:17.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang ginawa lang po ng ERC, paano ba natin papaiksiin yung time frame?

asr-001600
01:24:18.520 --> 01:24:24.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Huwag natin patagalin, lalo na sa paggawa po ng mga desisyon ng mga complaints ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-001601
01:24:24.540 --> 01:24:34.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nabanggit niyo kanina yung mga kakulangan pagdating sa personnel na kasama natin sa pagtitiyak ng mahigpit, malakas na regulasyon.

asr-001602
01:24:35.460 --> 01:24:37.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba kayong magbigay ng detalye tungkol dito?

asr-001603
01:24:38.440 --> 01:24:40.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, Madam Speaker,

asr-001604
01:24:41.120 --> 01:24:46.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: highly technical po ang kailangan po natin, even sa mga computations.

asr-001605
01:24:46.900 --> 01:24:49.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi lang po isang CPA, kaya po yan.

asr-001606
01:24:50.120 --> 01:24:53.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, medyo highly technical po ang pagdating sa kuryente.

asr-001607
01:24:54.440 --> 01:25:02.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We have to balance yung transformer, yung line, yung poste, from genco to transmission to DU to consumers, pilferage, etc.

asr-001608
01:25:02.540 --> 01:25:06.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we need highly technical people to do it.

asr-001609
01:25:06.020 --> 01:25:10.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And we need also na maging maganda rin po yung sweldo po nila.

asr-001610
01:25:11.120 --> 01:25:13.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil aminsan ang nangyari, na-train na po ng ERC,

asr-001611
01:25:13.900 --> 01:25:18.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pero pag may dumating na isang private company na mas maganda yung offer,

asr-001612
01:25:19.160 --> 01:25:21.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na napapirate pa po yung ating mga magagaling na tao.

asr-001613
01:25:22.420 --> 01:25:23.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, you just imagine,

asr-001614
01:25:24.080 --> 01:25:27.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang ERC po ay binabantayan trillion of peso industry,

asr-001615
01:25:28.420 --> 01:25:31.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pero ang pambantay mo, ang pulis mo, 900 million lamang.

asr-001616
01:25:32.500 --> 01:25:35.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, ganun po kahirap yung dinadaanan ng ERC.

asr-001617
01:25:35.700 --> 01:25:39.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: If Congress and even Senate, if we do not do something about it,

asr-001618
01:25:40.300 --> 01:25:41.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: if we do not,

asr-001619
01:25:41.120 --> 01:25:42.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: add the budget ng ERC,

asr-001620
01:25:43.160 --> 01:25:45.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: mas mamumroblema po ang taong bayan,

asr-001621
01:25:46.240 --> 01:25:51.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: lalo na kung hindi mababantayan o ma-reregulate ang kuryente dito po sa ating bayan.

asr-001622
01:25:51.980 --> 01:25:55.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, nagkaroon din ang pagdinig dito sa Kongreso,

asr-001623
01:25:55.900 --> 01:26:00.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: talakayan tungkol sa rotational brownout sa Visayas.

asr-001624
01:26:00.040 --> 01:26:10.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At isa po sa mga hinain ng ating mga consumers ay tungkol halimbawa po sa Iloilo City,

asr-001625
01:26:10.700 --> 01:26:18.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa More Power residential rate na nagkaroon po ng pagtaas nitong July 2026,

asr-001626
01:26:18.540 --> 01:26:26.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mula 13.91 per kilowatt hour tungong 14.349 per kilowatt hour.

asr-001627
01:26:26.700 --> 01:26:28.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po bang maipaliwanag ito ng ERC?

asr-001628
01:26:29.060 --> 01:26:31.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit po nagkakaroon pa rin ng mga pagtaas?

asr-001629
01:26:32.980 --> 01:26:37.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, in the Visayas, Madam Speaker, as I've explained a while ago with DOE,

asr-001630
01:26:37.700 --> 01:26:41.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung mga planta po talaga nag-breakdown.

asr-001631
01:26:42.920 --> 01:26:44.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, naging tight po yung supply.

asr-001632
01:26:45.460 --> 01:26:51.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But I've explained also, magbubukasan na po yung ating mga planta, may dates na po yan.

asr-001633
01:26:51.600 --> 01:26:56.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kaya lang the record is with DOE, now we are tackling ERC.

asr-001634
01:26:57.420 --> 01:27:03.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But I will give the details to our distinguished colleagues,

asr-001635
01:27:04.060 --> 01:27:06.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: if I may satisfy you with the answer,

asr-001636
01:27:07.700 --> 01:27:11.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: it's not only the problem of ERC, but even DOE.

asr-001637
01:27:11.720 --> 01:27:17.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, they're taking action regarding po sa yellow alert, red alert sa Visayas area.

asr-001638
01:27:18.580 --> 01:27:23.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Narinig natin na patong-patong po talaga yung pasanin ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-001639
01:27:24.980 --> 01:27:29.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod po sa pataas na presyo ng langis, na nakaka-apekto rin sa presyo ng kuryente,

asr-001640
01:27:30.080 --> 01:27:33.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ngayon, marami din mga pinapasan na iba't-ibang mga fees.

asr-001641
01:27:33.700 --> 01:27:37.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya, panahon na talaga para ma-review natin.

asr-001642
01:27:37.520 --> 01:27:39.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang lahat ng mga batas na kaugnay nito.

asr-001643
01:27:39.920 --> 01:27:44.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At matiyak din natin na kung tayo po ay mga mekanismo, may mekanismo para sa regulasyon,

asr-001644
01:27:45.140 --> 01:27:48.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay mahigpit ito na susuportahan ng ating pamahalaan.

asr-001645
01:27:49.340 --> 01:27:54.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At higit sa lahat, nabibigyan ng prioridad ang interes ng publiko, ang interes ng ating mga consumers.

asr-001646
01:27:55.040 --> 01:27:58.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat, Madam Speaker. Maraming salamat, Ginong Sponsor.

asr-001647
01:27:58.540 --> 01:28:00.240
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you. Majority Leader.

asr-001648
01:28:01.540 --> 01:28:07.320
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize Representative Dagooc of APEC Partylist for his interpellation.

asr-001649
01:28:07.520 --> 01:28:16.520
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Serge Dagooc of Partylist APEC is recognized for his interpolation.

asr-001650
01:28:16.520 --> 01:28:22.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Madam Speaker. Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-001651
01:28:22.520 --> 01:28:31.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magandang gabi po sa ating Energy Regulatory Commission headed by Chairman Nino at sa ating butihing sponsor.

asr-001652
01:28:31.520 --> 01:28:35.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ako po ay nahihiya magtanong.

asr-001653
01:28:35.520 --> 01:28:42.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi dahil sa napakaliit na budget, ang hirap po mag-utos kapag ka...

asr-001654
01:28:44.380 --> 01:28:51.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I really share the sentiment of the sponsor.

asr-001655
01:28:53.140 --> 01:29:04.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Paano po natin madisiplina yung ating mga nire-regulate?

asr-001656
01:29:05.520 --> 01:29:08.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mas magaling po yung mga tao doon sa planta kaysa taga-ERC.

asr-001657
01:29:09.720 --> 01:29:11.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, mahirap po talaga yan.

asr-001658
01:29:12.280 --> 01:29:21.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Imagine, even the Committee Secretary ng Energy, si Efrain Cortes, nasa generisyo na.

asr-001659
01:29:22.260 --> 01:29:23.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, paano?

asr-001660
01:29:24.380 --> 01:29:35.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, kaya ilimit ko na lang yung aking mga ano sa mga mangilang proposal.

asr-001661
01:29:35.520 --> 01:29:38.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: And recommendations doon sa mga rules natin.

asr-001662
01:29:39.300 --> 01:29:43.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Unang-una, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-001663
01:29:44.980 --> 01:29:49.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroon po tayong binabalangkas, including the Senate,

asr-001664
01:29:49.200 --> 01:29:59.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung removal ng non-technical losses at saka lowering the cap of our...

asr-001665
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:22.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, most probably, ang sinusulong ng Department of Energy, mga 7 billion na ipapautang sa mga particularly electric cooperatives. Kasi alam naman po natin lahat yan sa energy family na hindi mo po maipababa yung technical kung hindi mo gagastusan yung infra mo.

asr-001666
01:30:22.320 --> 01:30:45.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, sa tingin po ba ng Energy Regulatory Commission, Distinguished Sponsor, kailangan pa natin mag-create ng special unit para mapabilis yung evaluation and approval ng CAPEX intended for systems loss reduction.

asr-001667
01:30:45.740 --> 01:30:52.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Very specific po siya, for systems loss reduction program capital expenditures petition.

asr-001668
01:30:52.320 --> 01:30:54.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, totally agree.

asr-001669
01:30:55.500 --> 01:31:00.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor, Madam Speaker.

asr-001670
01:31:00.200 --> 01:31:10.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pangalawa po, siguro the ERC will agree with me na paikutan yung mga rules natin.

asr-001671
01:31:11.980 --> 01:31:14.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Banggitin ko na sa mga GENCO.

asr-001672
01:31:15.120 --> 01:31:22.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi upon reviewing the data given to me by NGCP,

asr-001673
01:31:22.320 --> 01:31:29.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa mga planta na involved sa Ancillary Services Procurement Agreement,

asr-001674
01:31:29.780 --> 01:31:36.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nakita ko may isang planta, tatlong bisis na ibinta yung ano niya.

asr-001675
01:31:37.340 --> 01:31:43.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nakita ko din, I hope I am wrong, but the ERC will evaluate this statement, no?

asr-001676
01:31:46.140 --> 01:31:50.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung ako may planta sa Luzon, Visayas, Mindanao,

asr-001677
01:31:50.440 --> 01:31:55.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pwede kong patirikin ang planta ko kahit saang isla.

asr-001678
01:31:56.940 --> 01:32:03.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dalawa-tatlong planta, halimbawa sampo yung planta ko, patirikin ko yung tatlo.

asr-001679
01:32:04.260 --> 01:32:11.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kikita pa rin ako ng mas malaki pa doon sa umaandar yung sampong planta ko.

asr-001680
01:32:11.460 --> 01:32:17.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Natitipid ko pa yung operating expenses ko sa tatlong planta dahil hindi siya umaandar.

asr-001681
01:32:17.620 --> 01:32:19.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Anong gagawin ko?

asr-001682
01:32:20.440 --> 01:32:23.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon ko ibibinta sa reserve market.

asr-001683
01:32:24.140 --> 01:32:27.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-001684
01:32:28.340 --> 01:32:37.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang tinutukoy ko dito kung may hiwalay ba na price determination methodology

asr-001685
01:32:37.440 --> 01:32:42.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang ginagamit sa wholesale electricity spot market at sa reserve market.

asr-001686
01:32:43.180 --> 01:32:44.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hiwalay po ba yung rules?

asr-001687
01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:48.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001688
01:32:49.360 --> 01:32:50.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And mas kailangan po.

asr-001689
01:32:50.440 --> 01:32:55.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mag-agree po natin siguro ng closer market monitoring para hindi po tayo nagkaka...

asr-001690
01:32:56.200 --> 01:32:57.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Alam po, alam po niyo po ang sagot.

asr-001691
01:32:57.860 --> 01:33:02.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kaya pag nag-retire po si Kong Seryo, pwede po yan sa DOE, pwede rin nga sa ERC.

asr-001692
01:33:03.620 --> 01:33:08.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Salamat at hindi ko na yun itanong kasi yung sagot mo yan yung...

asr-001693
01:33:08.500 --> 01:33:11.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang itatanong ko na lang, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-001694
01:33:14.680 --> 01:33:18.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mag-aagree ba ang Energy Regulatory Commission

asr-001695
01:33:18.200 --> 01:33:23.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na malaki yung possibility na tama yung hinala ko?

asr-001696
01:33:27.180 --> 01:33:28.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can we...

asr-001697
01:33:30.200 --> 01:33:35.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung sinabi ko kanina, Distinguished Sponsor, na itong planta na ito, na ibinta ganito.

asr-001698
01:33:35.600 --> 01:33:47.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, would the ERC agree with my observation na there is a possibility na pinaikutan nung mga ginko...

asr-001700
01:33:48.200 --> 01:33:50.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ...yung weakness ng mga rules natin?

asr-001701
01:33:50.840 --> 01:33:56.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker, in-orderan na po ang PMC ng ERC to investigate on this matter.

asr-001702
01:33:58.440 --> 01:33:59.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maganda po yun.

asr-001703
01:34:02.380 --> 01:34:03.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Makakatulong po yun.

asr-001704
01:34:03.240 --> 01:34:11.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero, again, I would like to reiterate na i-review natin yung rules kasi kung makikita mo yung data,

asr-001705
01:34:13.980 --> 01:34:18.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: lumiliit po yung transaction sa asamble.

asr-001706
01:34:18.200 --> 01:34:27.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero, palaki ng palaki in billions yung transaction sa reserve market.

asr-001707
01:34:28.340 --> 01:34:38.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Malinaw po na, binabato nila sa reserve market yung kanilang capacity doon sa mga umaandar nilang planta.

asr-001708
01:34:39.300 --> 01:34:47.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, tumataas yung ating market price sa reserve market tuwing nagkaroon ng yellow at red alert.

asr-001709
01:34:48.200 --> 01:34:55.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, sinabi ko po, kahit hindi umaandar itong planta na ito, yung kabila na umaandar, kumikita ng dubli.

asr-001710
01:34:55.500 --> 01:35:02.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, kahit wala itong operasyon, yung revenue nila ay parehas pa din o mas malaki pa.

asr-001711
01:35:03.440 --> 01:35:08.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yan po yung tinutukoy ko na pwedeng tingnan ng ERC.

asr-001712
01:35:09.300 --> 01:35:15.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we totally agree and review the policy regarding this matter, Madam Speaker.

asr-001713
01:35:15.400 --> 01:35:18.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001714
01:35:18.200 --> 01:35:20.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001715
01:35:20.900 --> 01:35:33.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon po sa policy ng ERC, sa deferment, naintindihan ko po na naawa po ang ating regulator dahil sa pagtaas.

asr-001716
01:35:34.640 --> 01:35:40.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, nagkaroon tayo ng mga advisory na huwag mo nang singilin, utay-utayin.

asr-001717
01:35:41.020 --> 01:35:47.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, doon po sa pag-utay-utay, baka lang po.

asr-001718
01:35:48.200 --> 01:36:01.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroong hindi nakikita ng ERC na ang working capital ng mga electric cooperatives na maliliit ay hindi po kakayanin yung apat na billing period.

asr-001719
01:36:01.620 --> 01:36:17.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ibig sabihin, kung malaking customer ang hindi nagbabayad at dahil maliit lang ang DSM nung electric cooperative na yun,

asr-001720
01:36:18.200 --> 01:36:32.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at malaki yung component nung generation, the possibility is hindi masahuran yung mga empleyado dyan kasi uunahin niya yung planta para hindi siya maputulan.

asr-001721
01:36:32.720 --> 01:36:46.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, po pwede po ba, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, na i-review ng ERC na very specific distribution utility, yung kanyang orderan,

asr-001722
01:36:46.440 --> 01:36:54.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dahil makikita naman po niya yung MAPSR, yung Monthly Financial and Statistical Report,

asr-001723
01:36:54.000 --> 01:37:06.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na itong co-op na ito, maliit lang ang working capital, hindi niya kakayanin ng 4 months, so i-a-allow siya na mas maiksi yung period.

asr-001724
01:37:08.160 --> 01:37:14.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, ito dahil yung working capital niya, nakikita sa cash flow statement yan,

asr-001725
01:37:14.120 --> 01:37:19.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ay medyo mataas yung PC niya, ay ito yung 4 months.

asr-001726
01:37:19.640 --> 01:37:25.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can the ERC, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, consider that?

asr-001727
01:37:27.900 --> 01:37:40.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, I totally agree with the Congressman Dagoog, but ang ERC po ay nililift na yung no disconnection policy.

asr-001728
01:37:41.120 --> 01:37:42.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As of October.

asr-001729
01:37:44.120 --> 01:37:49.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Except for residential areas with 200 kilowatt hour consumption.

asr-001730
01:37:49.840 --> 01:37:50.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay.

asr-001731
01:37:50.340 --> 01:37:50.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And below.

asr-001732
01:37:51.140 --> 01:37:53.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001733
01:37:54.240 --> 01:38:06.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, doon sa mga requirements natin sa permit sa planta, nare-review na po ba, Distinguished Sponsor, yung mga permit requirements natin?

asr-001734
01:38:06.740 --> 01:38:09.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Halimbawa, yung mga maliliit na planta.

asr-001735
01:38:10.940 --> 01:38:13.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Powerblock is the principal author of...

asr-001736
01:38:14.120 --> 01:38:15.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: The Microgrid Act.

asr-001737
01:38:16.340 --> 01:38:19.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, mga maliliit na isla yun, na planta.

asr-001738
01:38:19.840 --> 01:38:24.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang requirements, parihos lang sa mga malalaking planta.

asr-001739
01:38:24.880 --> 01:38:28.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 50 kilowatt, 100 kilowatt, natitinga.

asr-001740
01:38:29.740 --> 01:38:34.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos na, hindi maka-operate dahil mahirap i-comply.

asr-001741
01:38:34.240 --> 01:38:38.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, can the ERC review the requirements?

asr-001742
01:38:39.580 --> 01:38:43.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Then, huwag i-require doon sa mga maliliit yung requirements sa malalaki.

asr-001743
01:38:44.120 --> 01:38:47.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, that's a very good observation.

asr-001744
01:38:48.060 --> 01:38:53.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, regaling sa microgrid, actually po, na streamlined na po ng ERC.

asr-001745
01:38:53.480 --> 01:38:56.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nag-issue na po tayo noong...

asr-001746
01:38:57.540 --> 01:39:00.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Microgrid rules when?

asr-001747
01:39:02.440 --> 01:39:06.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: April 2026, Madam Speaker.

asr-001748
01:39:07.680 --> 01:39:08.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you.

asr-001749
01:39:09.160 --> 01:39:10.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung ganon.

asr-001750
01:39:10.700 --> 01:39:13.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, to be specific, sa dinagat...

asr-001751
01:39:14.120 --> 01:39:24.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon akong 50 kilowatt doon na donation nung parang sa German yun, or UCID.

asr-001752
01:39:25.280 --> 01:39:30.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hanggang ngayon, hindi pa naka-andar dahil sa hindi pa na-approve yung pinahil namin na permit.

asr-001753
01:39:31.440 --> 01:39:34.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, sayang. Sayang yung planta.

asr-001754
01:39:34.840 --> 01:39:38.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hybrid yun na solar at saka may genset.

asr-001755
01:39:38.440 --> 01:39:40.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Now, last na lang.

asr-001756
01:39:40.160 --> 01:39:41.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi ko na itatanong itong iba.

asr-001757
01:39:41.760 --> 01:39:43.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pwede ko namang kausapin si...

asr-001758
01:39:44.120 --> 01:39:45.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Chairman Nino.

asr-001759
01:39:46.320 --> 01:39:49.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung 2010 natin, Resolusyon...

asr-001760
01:39:49.840 --> 01:39:52.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Resolusyon number 10, series of 2023.

asr-001761
01:39:53.820 --> 01:39:55.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yan yung suspension ng...

asr-001762
01:39:56.400 --> 01:39:59.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pag-pass on ng franchise tax ni NGCP.

asr-001763
01:40:00.780 --> 01:40:04.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, na-suspend na natin yun.

asr-001764
01:40:04.820 --> 01:40:05.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Malaki po yung amount.

asr-001765
01:40:06.140 --> 01:40:08.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: That's 1.4 billion annually.

asr-001766
01:40:08.940 --> 01:40:11.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, may computation na po ba?

asr-001767
01:40:12.120 --> 01:40:12.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Si...

asr-001768
01:40:12.640 --> 01:40:13.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Because, during the time of...

asr-001769
01:40:14.120 --> 01:40:15.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Chair Muna,

asr-001770
01:40:16.140 --> 01:40:18.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: last kami nagka...

asr-001771
01:40:18.840 --> 01:40:21.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nag-discuss sa WIS and MINS, no?

asr-001772
01:40:21.940 --> 01:40:22.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sabi niya,

asr-001773
01:40:23.620 --> 01:40:26.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na nakita na nila yung up to 2015.

asr-001774
01:40:27.540 --> 01:40:29.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya hindi pa nila ma-determine.

asr-001775
01:40:29.480 --> 01:40:30.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Because I am...

asr-001776
01:40:30.360 --> 01:40:33.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I am asking for the refund

asr-001777
01:40:33.340 --> 01:40:35.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa illegally collected.

asr-001778
01:40:36.440 --> 01:40:40.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi naman po kasalanan ni Chair Muna yun at saka si Chair Nino.

asr-001779
01:40:41.020 --> 01:40:44.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, ibang chairman ng ERC,

asr-001780
01:40:44.120 --> 01:40:45.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang nagpahintolot

asr-001781
01:40:45.160 --> 01:40:50.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na ipasa ng NGCP yun illegally to the distribution utility.

asr-001782
01:40:51.540 --> 01:40:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Malaki pong halaga yan

asr-001783
01:40:52.600 --> 01:40:55.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi yung 1.4 billion na franchise tax,

asr-001784
01:40:56.200 --> 01:40:57.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: dahil nakapaloob sa gross receipts,

asr-001785
01:40:58.440 --> 01:41:00.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pinatunga na naman ng 12% na VAT.

asr-001786
01:41:01.000 --> 01:41:07.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, may I ask ERC kung nasaan na tayo ngayon

asr-001787
01:41:07.020 --> 01:41:09.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa pag-review ng mga nasingil?

asr-001788
01:41:09.940 --> 01:41:11.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, actually, as of now,

asr-001789
01:41:12.240 --> 01:41:13.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nire-review po natin yung...

asr-001790
01:41:13.440 --> 01:41:14.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung batas.

asr-001791
01:41:15.060 --> 01:41:16.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We have to be careful

asr-001792
01:41:16.720 --> 01:41:20.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung pwede pong retroactive po kasi, no?

asr-001793
01:41:20.840 --> 01:41:23.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, nire-review lang po yung batas

asr-001794
01:41:23.580 --> 01:41:24.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung pwede po natin gawin yun.

asr-001795
01:41:26.300 --> 01:41:27.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Madam Speaker,

asr-001796
01:41:27.780 --> 01:41:29.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: distinguished sponsor, no?

asr-001797
01:41:30.240 --> 01:41:31.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: With all juryspeak,

asr-001798
01:41:31.580 --> 01:41:32.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kahit hindi ako lawyer,

asr-001799
01:41:34.020 --> 01:41:35.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang...

asr-001800
01:41:35.180 --> 01:41:39.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: wala naman pong pag-usapan na retroactivity.

asr-001801
01:41:40.800 --> 01:41:41.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, from the beginning,

asr-001802
01:41:41.940 --> 01:41:42.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi po...

asr-001803
01:41:42.560 --> 01:41:45.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi po dapat pinahintulotan ng ERC

asr-001804
01:41:45.620 --> 01:41:49.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi section 9 of Republic Act 9511,

asr-001805
01:41:51.060 --> 01:41:54.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yan po yung batas na nagbigay ng franchise

asr-001806
01:41:54.400 --> 01:41:58.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa National Grid Corporation of the Philippines.

asr-001807
01:41:59.480 --> 01:42:01.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 69 states that

asr-001808
01:42:01.140 --> 01:42:03.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: the grantee

asr-001809
01:42:03.560 --> 01:42:07.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: is liable for a 3% franchise tax

asr-001810
01:42:07.820 --> 01:42:10.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: in liable taxes, period.

asr-001811
01:42:10.140 --> 01:42:12.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Wala pong dinugtong na sentence na...

asr-001812
01:42:12.560 --> 01:42:15.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: undefranchised tax can be passed on.

asr-001813
01:42:15.860 --> 01:42:16.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Wala po.

asr-001814
01:42:16.800 --> 01:42:19.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon po nanggaling yung argument ko.

asr-001815
01:42:19.880 --> 01:42:21.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nakita po yun ng BIR

asr-001816
01:42:21.340 --> 01:42:23.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at sinabi ng BIR,

asr-001817
01:42:24.280 --> 01:42:25.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: tama si Kongres Mandaguok,

asr-001818
01:42:26.300 --> 01:42:27.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi pwedeng ipasa.

asr-001819
01:42:27.540 --> 01:42:29.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nag-issue si ERC ng Resolution No. 10

asr-001820
01:42:29.940 --> 01:42:31.220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: noong 2023,

asr-001821
01:42:31.800 --> 01:42:32.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nahihinto.

asr-001822
01:42:32.900 --> 01:42:33.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya,

asr-001823
01:42:33.900 --> 01:42:35.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: maningil tayo ngayon,

asr-001824
01:42:36.840 --> 01:42:38.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung nakulikta illegally,

asr-001825
01:42:38.620 --> 01:42:39.220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: no?

asr-001826
01:42:39.560 --> 01:42:41.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mula noong na-approve yung petition ng NGCP,

asr-001827
01:42:42.560 --> 01:42:43.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na ipasa.

asr-001828
01:42:43.940 --> 01:42:45.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, palagay ko naman po,

asr-001829
01:42:45.720 --> 01:42:47.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: wala pong retroactivity issue.

asr-001830
01:42:48.140 --> 01:42:50.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I agree with Kongres Mandaguok,

asr-001831
01:42:50.380 --> 01:42:52.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: but the main problem is

asr-001832
01:42:52.840 --> 01:42:55.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nag-issue po kasi dati ng resolusyon

asr-001833
01:42:55.120 --> 01:42:57.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang ERC way back.

asr-001834
01:42:57.680 --> 01:42:59.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi po pa naon ni Charmona,

asr-001835
01:42:59.440 --> 01:43:00.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: hindi po pa naon ngayon.

asr-001836
01:43:00.340 --> 01:43:00.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kaya nga po,

asr-001837
01:43:01.180 --> 01:43:03.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pinag-aaralan po natin na maigi

asr-001838
01:43:03.100 --> 01:43:06.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil kawawa naman po yung ating pong mga nag-implement.

asr-001839
01:43:07.220 --> 01:43:08.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Konting mali,

asr-001840
01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:09.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: baka sila po yung makasuhan

asr-001841
01:43:09.420 --> 01:43:10.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kahit tama na po yung ating ginagawa.

asr-001842
01:43:11.100 --> 01:43:12.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we are just being careful.

asr-001843
01:43:12.980 --> 01:43:14.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Mr. Speaker, Madam Speaker.

asr-001844
01:43:15.200 --> 01:43:16.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kawawa naman po tayo

asr-001845
01:43:16.580 --> 01:43:17.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi pati ako,

asr-001846
01:43:17.480 --> 01:43:18.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nagbabayad ako ng kuryente.

asr-001847
01:43:19.700 --> 01:43:23.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Binabayaran ko yung illegally collected na franchise tax.

asr-001848
01:43:23.800 --> 01:43:25.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, pinatungan pa ng VAT.

asr-001849
01:43:25.620 --> 01:43:26.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tax na ngayon.

asr-001850
01:43:27.180 --> 01:43:28.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, tinax ulit.

asr-001851
01:43:28.460 --> 01:43:29.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, anyway.

asr-001852
01:43:32.780 --> 01:43:35.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ganon na lang ang mga katanungan ko.

asr-001853
01:43:35.420 --> 01:43:37.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Diyan na lang po, Madam Speaker.

asr-001854
01:43:37.380 --> 01:43:38.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming salamat sa pagsagot,

asr-001855
01:43:38.980 --> 01:43:39.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-001856
01:43:40.200 --> 01:43:41.220
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming salamat, ERC.

asr-001857
01:43:41.940 --> 01:43:42.500
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Thank you.

asr-001858
01:43:42.560 --> 01:43:43.480
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-001859
01:43:44.020 --> 01:43:46.300
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize

asr-001860
01:43:46.300 --> 01:43:48.360
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Minority Floor Leader, Libanan,

asr-001861
01:43:48.700 --> 01:43:49.720
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: for his interpellation.

asr-001862
01:43:49.740 --> 01:43:51.040
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Libanan is recognized.

asr-001863
01:43:55.540 --> 01:43:58.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Marami pong salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-001864
01:43:58.600 --> 01:43:59.660
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker,

asr-001865
01:44:00.240 --> 01:44:00.900
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I would like to,

asr-001866
01:44:01.560 --> 01:44:02.360
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: this presentation,

asr-001867
01:44:02.620 --> 01:44:03.660
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: I would like to ask

asr-001868
01:44:03.660 --> 01:44:06.300
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: if the sponsor is willing to answer

asr-001869
01:44:06.300 --> 01:44:07.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: some interpellations.

asr-001870
01:44:12.560 --> 01:44:14.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001871
01:44:15.400 --> 01:44:16.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001872
01:44:17.380 --> 01:44:19.340
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker, tungkol po ito sa

asr-001873
01:44:19.340 --> 01:44:21.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: line loss congestion charge.

asr-001874
01:44:22.660 --> 01:44:24.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Yung line loss congestion charge,

asr-001875
01:44:24.800 --> 01:44:26.660
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ang cooperative,

asr-001876
01:44:27.660 --> 01:44:28.580
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: electric cooperatives

asr-001877
01:44:28.580 --> 01:44:29.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ng Region 8

asr-001878
01:44:29.600 --> 01:44:31.580
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at saka Region 6

asr-001879
01:44:31.580 --> 01:44:33.340
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ay

asr-001880
01:44:33.340 --> 01:44:35.720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: nagbibili sa WESM

asr-001881
01:44:35.720 --> 01:44:38.340
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: at

asr-001882
01:44:38.340 --> 01:44:40.360
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: kung ang nabibili nila

asr-001883
01:44:40.360 --> 01:44:41.700
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: ay galing Luzon na

asr-001884
01:44:41.700 --> 01:44:43.900
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: GENCO

asr-001885
01:44:43.900 --> 01:44:46.720
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: generating company.

asr-001886
01:44:47.900 --> 01:44:50.200
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At nagkakakongestiyon

asr-001887
01:44:50.200 --> 01:44:51.100
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: dyan sa

asr-001888
01:44:51.100 --> 01:44:53.200
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Luzon grid.

asr-001889
01:44:54.560 --> 01:44:56.380
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Hindi na ipapadala yung kuryente

asr-001890
01:44:56.380 --> 01:44:58.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: sa Region 6 at saka Region 8

asr-001891
01:44:58.400 --> 01:44:59.300
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: pero

asr-001892
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:17.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sinacharge pa rin ang electric cooperatives. Nung tinignan ko po yung billing sa Eastern Summit, yung 13 pesos ay umaabot ng 18 pesos.

asr-001893
01:45:17.120 --> 01:45:31.840
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At kung ang hindi nagbayad na electric cooperative ay sisingilin, aabot po ng 25 pesos per kilowatt hour ang babayaran po.

asr-001894
01:45:32.360 --> 01:45:46.640
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Napaka-unfair po ito dahil hindi naman ito nagamit ng consumers. Hindi ito dumating sa Region 8 at sa Region 6. At napag-usapan din po namin ito nung pre-budget briefing.

asr-001895
01:45:47.120 --> 01:46:05.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At nung August 13, 2026, nagbigay ng order ang ERC to adopt an interim measure suspending collection payment of LRTA for trading intervals where different system marginal prices arise because of congestion.

asr-001896
01:46:09.340 --> 01:46:16.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: The suspension is not blanket. It applies only when the conditions specified by ERC exist.

asr-001897
01:46:17.120 --> 01:46:18.120
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Tama po ba?

asr-001898
01:46:19.720 --> 01:46:21.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001899
01:46:22.320 --> 01:46:25.020
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker, yung...

asr-001900
01:46:25.020 --> 01:46:43.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: If I may add, Minority Leader, kung kailan po nag-arise yung problema, kaya nga po nag-order yung ating ERC nung August 13, 2026 sa IMAP to recalculate the allocation of the net settlement surplus.

asr-001901
01:46:44.300 --> 01:46:45.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Even nung simula.

asr-001902
01:46:46.240 --> 01:46:46.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So hindi lang po yung...

asr-001903
01:46:47.120 --> 01:46:49.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Simula pa nung June 2021.

asr-001904
01:46:50.440 --> 01:46:55.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At kung makita po, basing doon sa investigation, kung may kailangan pong ibalik na pera,

asr-001905
01:46:55.920 --> 01:47:05.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: i-re-rebate rin po yun sa mga consumers po natin na yun po yung concern na ni Minority Leader Limanan.

asr-001906
01:47:06.860 --> 01:47:09.080
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maraming salamat po, Madam Speaker, sa answer.

asr-001907
01:47:09.080 --> 01:47:17.080
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Pero ang IMOP ay sumulat pa rin sa isa mail ko na hindi nila...

asr-001908
01:47:17.120 --> 01:47:19.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: na hindi nila nire-recognize yata yung suspension.

asr-001909
01:47:19.300 --> 01:47:20.900
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Dahil suspension lang ito eh.

asr-001910
01:47:22.360 --> 01:47:23.560
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: For 30 days.

asr-001911
01:47:24.400 --> 01:47:25.360
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: E paano po ito?

asr-001912
01:47:25.520 --> 01:47:34.000
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sabi ko nga, pag-implement ito, 25 pesos per kilowatt hour ng babayaran, parang papatay na natin ang mga consumers.

asr-001913
01:47:34.000 --> 01:47:36.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I think dalawa po yun.

asr-001914
01:47:36.240 --> 01:47:37.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So different po.

asr-001915
01:47:37.080 --> 01:47:45.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yung bago pong order ng ating pong ERC is effective September ngayon po.

asr-001916
01:47:47.120 --> 01:47:53.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pero yung sinasabi niyo po sa IMOP na kausap pa yung pinu-collect ng IMOP sa mail ko,

asr-001917
01:47:54.760 --> 01:47:58.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: prior month pa po yun.

asr-001918
01:47:58.380 --> 01:48:08.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So this is a new order, Madam Speaker, na kailangan pong sundin ng IMOP regarding sa computation.

asr-001919
01:48:08.940 --> 01:48:10.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So we have to recalculate.

asr-001920
01:48:10.260 --> 01:48:16.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Hindi lang po ngayon, but way back 2021, because the chairman...

asr-001921
01:48:17.120 --> 01:48:25.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ERC mismo, naiintindihan po yung sitwasyon ng ating mga kababayan sa distrito po ng minority leader.

asr-001922
01:48:26.020 --> 01:48:27.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So they have to follow.

asr-001923
01:48:28.600 --> 01:48:29.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001924
01:48:29.520 --> 01:48:30.560
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker.

asr-001925
01:48:30.560 --> 01:48:42.980
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Anyway, Madam Speaker, magkano na ba ang total amount na nakulekta mula June 2021 ng IMOP at pinaghati-hatian ng mga GINCOs?

asr-001926
01:48:43.480 --> 01:48:46.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, Madam Speaker, if I may, can you give us...

asr-001927
01:48:47.120 --> 01:48:55.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At the same time, we will ask IMOP to submit yung kanilang calculation to the ERC and will be given to the minority leader.

asr-001928
01:48:55.920 --> 01:48:56.800
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001929
01:48:57.800 --> 01:49:08.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Madam Speaker, may principle tayo in civil law na tinatawag na solutio indebiti, unjust enrichment.

asr-001930
01:49:09.040 --> 01:49:12.060
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Bawal po ito sa ating batas.

asr-001931
01:49:12.760 --> 01:49:14.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Hindi na gamit pero kukuliktahin.

asr-001932
01:49:15.120 --> 01:49:19.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kaya kung maaari po, bigyan ng permanent solution po ito.

asr-001932-split-2
01:49:19.920 --> 01:49:20.679
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-001932-split-3
01:49:20.679 --> 01:49:25.280
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Na fair at saka madalian,

asr-001933
01:49:25.280 --> 01:49:29.920
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: bago maghingalo ang ating electric cooperatives at ang ating consumers po, Madam Speaker.

asr-001934
01:49:29.920 --> 01:49:31.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Totally agree, Madam Speaker.

asr-001935
01:49:31.640 --> 01:49:40.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And within the month, nag-commit po ang ERC na isasubmit po sa inyo yung kung magkano yung total.

asr-001936
01:49:41.340 --> 01:49:45.600
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At saka, Madam Speaker, hindi lang submission kundi reimbursement.

asr-001937
01:49:46.240 --> 01:49:46.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Reimbursement.

asr-001938
01:49:47.120 --> 01:49:48.400
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Sa lahat ng mga consumers.

asr-001939
01:49:48.760 --> 01:49:55.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: After the submission, pag-aaralan po yan kung may nakita po or hindi lang po yan ng ERC na ibalik po sa consumer.

asr-001940
01:49:56.160 --> 01:50:05.760
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: At Madam Speaker, sana ay dapat wala ng kultura natin na mangungulikta muna bago isa uli, di ba?

asr-001941
01:50:06.580 --> 01:50:07.540
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Mawala na yun.

asr-001942
01:50:08.100 --> 01:50:09.860
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Kakahiya po yan, Madam Speaker.

asr-001943
01:50:10.620 --> 01:50:14.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Lalo na't may hirap na mga probinsya po ito.

asr-001944
01:50:14.620 --> 01:50:16.620
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: So, sana po ay...

asr-001945
01:50:17.120 --> 01:50:19.520
Minority Leader Marcelino C. Libanan: Huwag na nating ugaliin po yan.

asr-001946
01:50:20.440 --> 01:50:22.400
