asr-002511
03:37:30.000 --> 03:37:59.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Speaker, colleagues, I rise to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the Civil Service Commission, including the Career Executive Service Board. As the central human resource agency of the government, the CSC carries a constitutional mandate that goes to the very heart of effective governance,

asr-002512
03:38:00.000 --> 03:38:31.880
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ensuring that appointments and personnel actions in the public service are guided by merit and fitness, while promoting professionalism, integrity, efficiency, responsiveness, and accountability among our public servants. The proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of 4.04 billion pesos, including automatic appropriations,

asr-002513
03:38:31.880 --> 03:38:59.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: will support the Commission's core functions, including human resource governance, professionalization in the workplace, [unclear] and administrative justice, as well as the continuing Philippine Civil Service Modernization Project, which will support the digital conversion of HR systems, records and [unclear].

asr-002514
03:39:00.000 --> 03:39:29.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The Career Executive Service Board, meanwhile, is proposing a budget of 142.86 million. The Board plays an important role in developing and maintaining a competent executive service that provides continuity, professionalism, [unclear] leadership in government. With this consideration,

asr-002515
03:39:30.000 --> 03:39:32.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: I respectfully present the proposed

asr-002516
03:39:32.000 --> 03:39:34.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: fiscal year 2027 budget of the

asr-002517
03:39:34.000 --> 03:39:36.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Civil Service Commission, including

asr-002518
03:39:36.000 --> 03:39:38.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: the Career Executive Service Board,

asr-002519
03:39:38.000 --> 03:39:40.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: for the consideration of

asr-002520
03:39:40.000 --> 03:39:43.160
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: this honorable body.

asr-002521
03:39:43.160 --> 03:39:45.500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

