asr-002530
03:40:01.880 --> 03:40:05.239
Rep. Aniela Bianca D. Tolentino: Representative Rene Co from the Kabataan Party List.

asr-002530-split-2
03:40:05.239 --> 03:40:11.800
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Majority Leader. Representative Co of the Kabataan Party List is recognized to interpellate the sponsor.

asr-002531
03:40:13.120 --> 03:40:14.120
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Please proceed, ma'am.

asr-002532
03:40:14.780 --> 03:40:22.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat, Ginong Speaker, at magandang gabi po sa Distinguished Sponsor natin at sa Civil Service Commission.

asr-002533
03:40:22.620 --> 03:40:32.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Noong nakaraang taon, meron din po tayong mga katanungan tungkol sa kalagayan ng kabataan at ating mga lingkod bayan.

asr-002534
03:40:32.800 --> 03:40:52.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And in particular, na-note po natin na may mga bagong resolusyon galing sa Civil Service Commission, particularly No. 25752 tungkol po sa eligibility of SK officers na maaari pong makonsidera for first-level positions in the career service.

asr-002535
03:40:52.620 --> 03:41:04.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At No. 25229, o ang updated guidelines kung paano po makaka-qualify ang K-to-12 na magserbisyo sa gobyerno.

asr-002536
03:41:04.660 --> 03:41:22.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron din po tayong concern sa kung paano ang mga local government unit offices na nare-reassign sa ibang opisina ng LGU kapag hindi po kasundo ang local elective officials, at ano pong aksyon ng CSC na maaaring

asr-002537
03:41:22.620 --> 03:41:52.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: i-undertake para po hindi ma-upend yung civil service tungkol dito. Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, maaari po bang magsumite ng request ang kinatawan na ito para po makahingi ng mga updates tungkol po sa mga resolusyon na ito, para po makita natin kung paano naaalagaan ng CSC ang kalagayan ng kabataan at ating mga lokal na lingkod bayan?

asr-002538
03:41:52.620 --> 03:42:00.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: We will provide copies of the resolution tomorrow.

asr-002539
03:42:01.200 --> 03:42:02.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maraming salamat po at sana rin.

asr-002540
03:42:02.800 --> 03:42:15.680
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Speaker, siguro puwede kong sagutin yung tungkol sa chief executive na tinanong ng ating kagalang-galang na Kabataan Party List.

asr-002541
03:42:16.940 --> 03:42:18.220
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Sir Speaker,

asr-002542
03:42:18.220 --> 03:42:31.220
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Halimbawa, sa isang [unclear] plantilla, tapos nagpalit ng chief executive, inilipat ka sa sanitary inspection, bawal.

asr-002543
03:42:32.560 --> 03:42:40.900
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Halimbawa, isa kang budget officer, tapos [unclear] para maging [unclear] collector, bawal.

asr-002544
03:42:42.100 --> 03:42:45.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Dahil hindi iyon ang iyong appointed plantilya position.

asr-002545
03:42:46.120 --> 03:42:48.200
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kung ikaw ay municipal engineer,

asr-002546
03:42:48.220 --> 03:42:55.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: at nagpalit ng chief executive at nilagay ka sa solid waste office, bawal.

asr-002547
03:42:57.240 --> 03:43:14.060
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The reason for this, Mr. Speaker, is that it violates Rule Number 4, Section 13 of the 2025 Rules on Appointments and Other Human Resource Actions, CSC rule na ito.

asr-002548
03:43:14.060 --> 03:43:18.200
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Maituturing na constructive dismissal ang ganitong gawain.

asr-002549
03:43:18.220 --> 03:43:23.920
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At maaaring magreklamo ang kawalin ng gobyerno sa Civil Service Commission.

asr-002550
03:43:24.840 --> 03:43:30.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, maraming salamat po sa klarifikasyon na ito.

asr-002551
03:43:30.540 --> 03:43:43.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At sana po ay maging gabay ito sa mga lingkod bayan natin na nahaharap sa ganitong issue, na sana po ay mas na-streamline ang ating local civil service kung hindi po nahaharap sa ganitong klaseng

asr-002552
03:43:43.400 --> 03:43:46.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And I'd say it, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor ng pamumulitika.

asr-002553
03:43:46.740 --> 03:43:47.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-002554
03:43:48.220 --> 03:44:06.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hihintayin po natin, hindi lang yung kopya ng resolusyon na iyon, pero pati rin po yung ulat tungkol po sa kung paano po nagkaroon ng pagpasok ng mga additional SK at even K-to-12 graduates sa mga posisyon ng civil service pagkatapos po ng resolusyon na iyon.

asr-002555
03:44:06.620 --> 03:44:08.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maaaring po ba itong maibigay, Mr. Speaker?

asr-002556
03:44:08.240 --> 03:44:10.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Speaker, yes po.

asr-002557
03:44:10.680 --> 03:44:17.240
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bukas po ng umaga o maghapon, ibibigay po ang hiningi ng ating kasamang kabataan.

asr-002558
03:44:18.220 --> 03:44:32.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang huling concern na lang po natin, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, ay dahil nakita natin na mahalaga din yung pambansang civil service natin at natutuloy-tuloy yung kanilang gawain,

asr-002559
03:44:32.800 --> 03:44:48.200
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang Career Executive Service Board ay meron pong funding requirement na 66 million na on the record ay gusto natin mailatag at maikonsidera ng plenaryo para po ang kanilang main building.

asr-002560
03:44:48.220 --> 03:44:52.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and resource center capacity building ay maisagawa po nang maayos.

asr-002561
03:44:53.280 --> 03:44:57.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: At the proper time, this representative will make the proper solution.

asr-002562
03:44:57.720 --> 03:45:00.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: For now, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-002563
03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:15.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Being that there are no other questions from the members of the minority, I move to terminate the deliberations of the budget of the Civil Service Commission. So moved, Mr. Chair.

