Rep. Aniela Bianca D. Tolentino: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpellations on the proposed budget of the Civil Service Commission.

asr-002566
03:45:28.540 --> 03:45:37.480
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Majority Leader. There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the Civil Service Commission.

asr-002567
