03:46:05.760 --> 03:46:09.300
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The Chair used to be our General Secretary of this Congress.

asr-002573
03:46:10.020 --> 03:46:10.960
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you very much.

asr-002574
03:46:17.140 --> 03:46:18.160
Rep. Aniela Bianca D. Tolentino: Mr. Speaker.

asr-002575
03:46:19.540 --> 03:46:21.860
Rep. Aniela Bianca D. Tolentino: Mr. Speaker, I move to suspend session.

asr-002576
03:46:21.860 --> 03:46:23.040
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Majority Leader.

asr-002577
03:46:23.440 --> 03:46:25.040
Rep. Aniela Bianca D. Tolentino: I move to suspend session for a few minutes.

asr-002578
