Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Well, yes, 3rd District, Quezon, Vice Chair Renante U. Arogancia. Majority Leader, please.

asr-002690
04:01:14.800 --> 04:01:24.180
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Sergio Dagooc of APEC Party List to interpolate on the proposed budget.

asr-002691
04:01:24.520 --> 04:01:26.180
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The gentleman from APEC.

asr-002692
04:01:26.740 --> 04:01:30.060
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: APEC Party List, Representative Sergio C. Dagooc.

asr-002693
04:01:30.360 --> 04:01:31.240
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: You may proceed, sir.

asr-002694
04:01:31.940 --> 04:01:35.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-002695
04:01:36.880 --> 04:01:48.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayong gabi sa atong amigo, sa Distinguished Sponsor, at sa lahat ng mga taga DOTr.

asr-002696
04:01:52.640 --> 04:01:56.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tanggalan ko po ng 70% yung katanungan.

asr-002697
04:01:56.740 --> 04:02:01.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Gusto kong makapagpahinga na yung kaibigan ko sa Samar.

asr-002698
04:02:04.280 --> 04:02:10.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Would the Distinguished Sponsor yield to, instead of 17, only 4?

asr-002699
04:02:13.180 --> 04:02:14.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Clarificatory questions.

asr-002700
04:02:18.760 --> 04:02:21.740
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yes, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002701
04:02:21.740 --> 04:02:22.380
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Colleague?

asr-002702
04:02:23.460 --> 04:02:26.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Unang-una, ito ay pinaabot lang sa akin.

asr-002703
04:02:26.740 --> 04:02:35.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nung mga some majority members from Mindanao.

asr-002704
04:02:39.560 --> 04:02:42.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ayaw ko kasing magsinungaling.

asr-002705
04:02:42.300 --> 04:02:43.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi ito kasama sa ano ko.

asr-002706
04:02:43.800 --> 04:02:47.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero I found it very relevant.

asr-002707
04:02:48.260 --> 04:02:55.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Itong modernisisyon natin sa public transport, may mga subsidy po ito noon.

asr-002708
04:02:55.500 --> 04:02:55.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay.

asr-002709
04:02:56.740 --> 04:02:57.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nangungutang na po sila.

asr-002710
04:02:58.820 --> 04:03:02.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon, parang bigla nating tinanggal sa budget.

asr-002711
04:03:03.160 --> 04:03:04.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ano mangyari sa kanila?

asr-002712
04:03:04.980 --> 04:03:10.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi nila mabayaran yung kanilang mga amortisisyon.

asr-002713
04:03:11.420 --> 04:03:14.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ano po ang tugon nito sa ating kagawaran?

asr-002714
04:03:15.600 --> 04:03:17.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished Sponsor, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002715
04:03:18.420 --> 04:03:20.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Maraming salamat po, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002716
04:03:21.180 --> 04:03:23.980
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Malaking bagay po ngayon, ang katanungan na yan,

asr-002717
04:03:23.980 --> 04:03:26.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: ay nabigyan po ng budget ng 1.5 billion.

asr-002718
04:03:26.740 --> 04:03:35.060
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Para po sa subsidy ng pagbayad po nung mga loans na amortisisyon,

asr-002719
04:03:35.180 --> 04:03:38.440
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: loans na ibigay ng DBP and Land Bank.

asr-002720
04:03:39.700 --> 04:03:43.900
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dito po, two tranches po ito.

asr-002721
04:03:44.460 --> 04:03:50.860
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mayroon pong 600M na nakalaan para sa mga public utility vehicles

asr-002722
04:03:50.860 --> 04:03:56.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: na makakatanggap po sila ng 20,000 kada taon.

asr-002723
04:03:56.720 --> 04:03:59.660
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For, kada buwan, for 3 months.

asr-002724
04:04:00.340 --> 04:04:06.580
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: So, makakabawas po ito, makakapagbigay ng paluwag dito po sa kanilang amortisisyon.

asr-002725
04:04:07.260 --> 04:04:11.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: At, mayroon po rin mga 450M para po sa fuel discount.

asr-002726
04:04:12.360 --> 04:04:18.340
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kung di po ko nagkakamali, lumalabas po na 12 pesos per liter para po dito sa fuel discounts.

asr-002727
04:04:19.480 --> 04:04:21.620
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Distinguished Colleague, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002728
04:04:22.480 --> 04:04:24.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-002729
04:04:24.760 --> 04:04:26.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, sa makatawid.

asr-002730
04:04:26.720 --> 04:04:33.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi naman po pala totoo na wala tayong subsidy for 2027.

asr-002731
04:04:33.920 --> 04:04:35.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ano po ito? Amortisisyon po.

asr-002732
04:04:36.300 --> 04:04:39.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang problem pala po, Mr. Distinguished Colleague,

asr-002733
04:04:39.960 --> 04:04:45.540
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: ang fuel subsidy, wala pong pondo and ang service contract program.

asr-002734
04:04:45.680 --> 04:04:49.320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yan po ang wala pong pondong na ibigay ang DBM.

asr-002735
04:04:49.320 --> 04:04:55.260
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Pero may proposal po sana ang DOTR na 5B for fuel subsidy.

asr-002736
04:04:56.060 --> 04:04:56.400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: And,

asr-002737
04:04:56.720 --> 04:05:00.040
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: 5B for service contracting program.

asr-002738
04:05:00.040 --> 04:05:03.280
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang problema, 4B para po sa land-based.

asr-002739
04:05:03.960 --> 04:05:05.660
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: 1B for marine-based.

asr-002740
04:05:07.900 --> 04:05:13.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang tinutukoy kanina, Distinguished Sponsor, ay subsidy para sa amortisisyon.

asr-002741
04:05:13.800 --> 04:05:19.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi ang issue nila, yung mga utang nila dahil sa modernisisyon natin.

asr-002742
04:05:20.420 --> 04:05:24.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, mayroon naman palang subsidy para sa amortisisyon.

asr-002743
04:05:24.440 --> 04:05:24.920
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mayroon po.

asr-002744
04:05:25.920 --> 04:05:26.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay.

asr-002745
04:05:26.180 --> 04:05:26.700
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For this year po yan.

asr-002746
04:05:26.720 --> 04:05:30.640
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sa 2027, 1.7 billion po nakalaan.

asr-002747
04:05:30.940 --> 04:05:33.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-002748
04:05:33.640 --> 04:05:44.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang susunod ko pong katanungan, mayroon po tayong iba-ibang mode of transportation.

asr-002749
04:05:45.380 --> 04:05:50.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pwede ko po bang matanong ang aking kaibigan na sponsor,

asr-002750
04:05:51.480 --> 04:05:55.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ilan po ba talaga yung mode of transportation natin sa buong bansa?

asr-002751
04:05:56.720 --> 04:05:59.700
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Land, air, marine, and rail po.

asr-002752
04:06:00.640 --> 04:06:07.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, napapansin ko po, tuwing may mga crisis,

asr-002753
04:06:08.380 --> 04:06:18.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang palagi lang nating nasusubsidize yung land, mga bus, jeepneys.

asr-002754
04:06:20.800 --> 04:06:24.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ang issue na ito is reiteration.

asr-002755
04:06:24.720 --> 04:06:26.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nung tayo ay nagbalangkala,

asr-002756
04:06:26.720 --> 04:06:36.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: doon sa special power ni Presidente to suspend excise tax noong nag-break tayo.

asr-002757
04:06:37.280 --> 04:06:47.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ngayon po ba sa 2027 na NEP ng DOTR, sinama na po ba yung other mode of transportation?

asr-002758
04:06:48.300 --> 04:06:50.500
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Salamat po, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002759
04:06:50.800 --> 04:06:55.240
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Pinakamalaki pong nabadgetan po ngayon ang rail transport program po, RTP.

asr-002760
04:06:55.240 --> 04:06:55.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Halos.

asr-002761
04:06:55.680 --> 04:07:03.340
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kala po ng mga 72.4% po under RTP, under OSEC po.

asr-002762
04:07:04.120 --> 04:07:10.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: And ang second biggest is the maritime infrastructure program, mga 6.7%.

asr-002763
04:07:10.600 --> 04:07:15.400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: And the land public transportation program, 6.1%.

asr-002764
04:07:15.400 --> 04:07:21.480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yan po ay yung unang tatlong pinakamalaking pondo na ilaan para sa DOTR.

asr-002765
04:07:22.440 --> 04:07:24.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-002766
04:07:25.020 --> 04:07:26.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroon na po tayong

asr-002769
04:07:26.100 --> 04:07:30.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: maritime subsidy. Magkano po yan?

asr-002769-split-2
04:07:30.180 --> 04:07:42.880
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Lumalabas po, 18,000, 18 million, 18,137 million for maritime infrastructure program.

asr-002769-split-3
04:07:42.880 --> 04:07:52.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Puwede po bang malaman ano yung specific na inaalaw na paggagamitan ng pondong yan?

asr-002771
04:07:55.680 --> 04:08:10.040
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mayroon po sana nakalaan na 1 billion para sa maritime based program, service contract po, program.

asr-002772
04:08:10.260 --> 04:08:15.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang problema lang po, hindi po naisama sa NEP, pero yan po yung proposal ng DOTR.

asr-002773
04:08:16.260 --> 04:08:19.240
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: During the budget legislation, hindi lang po naisama ng DBM.

asr-002774
04:08:19.740 --> 04:08:26.040
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yung 1 billion out of the 5 billion para po sa service contracting

asr-002775
04:08:26.040 --> 04:08:27.100
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Program.

asr-002776
04:08:27.100 --> 04:08:32.350
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: [unclear] ko po naitanong 'yan, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-002777
04:08:32.900 --> 04:08:37.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam naman po natin na ang Pilipinas ay napakaraming isla.

asr-002778
04:08:38.840 --> 04:08:45.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya po, nagtataka ako bakit nakatotok lang tayo sa mga jeepney bus.

asr-002779
04:08:46.420 --> 04:08:49.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung paabay tinotoka natin dahil nagra-rally sila,

asr-002780
04:08:50.320 --> 04:08:52.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nag-transport strike.

asr-002781
04:08:53.040 --> 04:08:55.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dahil po ba yung mga pump boats,

asr-002782
04:08:55.640 --> 04:09:03.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sa Siargao, sa Dinaga at sa Rumblon, doon sa Samar, ay walang subsidy yung mga pasahero doon

asr-002783
04:09:03.680 --> 04:09:08.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kahit nagmahal na yung pamasahe dahil sa fuel, dahil hindi sila nagra-rally.

asr-002784
04:09:09.360 --> 04:09:15.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung totoosin, pwede naman pong maglakad yung nasa lupa, pero kami po sa isla,

asr-002785
04:09:15.740 --> 04:09:18.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi po namin pwedeng lakarin para makatawid kami sa kabila.

asr-002786
04:09:19.340 --> 04:09:23.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kailangan namin sumakay. Dito pwedeng mag-bike, pwedeng mag-jogging.

asr-002787
04:09:23.640 --> 04:09:27.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon po, hindi po namin magagawa yun.

asr-002788
04:09:27.340 --> 04:09:38.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So bakit po, sa napakaraming taon na nagdaan, tuwing may crisis, jeep nilang, bus lang ang may subsidy?

asr-002789
04:09:40.560 --> 04:09:43.580
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, tama po yan.

asr-002790
04:09:44.200 --> 04:09:51.900
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mabuti lang po ang DOTR ay nakalaan po ng 200 million para po sa maritime programs for 2026

asr-002791
04:09:51.900 --> 04:09:52.900
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: under the service contract.

asr-002792
04:09:53.640 --> 04:09:55.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Contracting program.

asr-002793
04:09:56.140 --> 04:10:00.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: And sa 2027, mayroong pong 1 billion na nakalaan.

asr-002794
04:10:00.780 --> 04:10:06.360
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kaya lang sa kasamang palad, hindi po naisama sa, ng DBM sa, during the budget legislation.

asr-002795
04:10:06.880 --> 04:10:07.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yun nga.

asr-002796
04:10:07.100 --> 04:10:07.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished colleague.

asr-002797
04:10:08.260 --> 04:10:14.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, kaya talagang sasamayin ang palad namin sa, sa taga-isla.

asr-002798
04:10:14.540 --> 04:10:16.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So siguro mag-strike na lang din kami, taga-summer.

asr-002799
04:10:17.400 --> 04:10:20.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi na magbibiyahi yung mga pampot sa Romblon.

asr-002800
04:10:20.360 --> 04:10:23.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana po, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor.

asr-002801
04:10:23.640 --> 04:10:35.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: May I appeal to DOTR na kayo, kayo, kayo po kasi yung mandated, no, sa transportation.

asr-002802
04:10:36.180 --> 04:10:45.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mandate po ninyo na equal, nasaan na po yung equal protection clause natin na pinili lang natin yung ibang sektor sa transportation.

asr-002803
04:10:46.080 --> 04:10:53.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi naman po, po pwede, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, na ang sagot lang natin sa mga taga-isla,

asr-002804
04:10:53.640 --> 04:11:01.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: magtiis kayo kasi sa kasamaang palad, hindi naisama ng, ah, DBM yung, ah, subsidy.

asr-002805
04:11:01.460 --> 04:11:05.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung 200 million po, ah, I appreciate that, no.

asr-002806
04:11:05.900 --> 04:11:15.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I can attest na nakarating din po sa dinagat yan sa Siargao, pero sampung araw lang po yung, ah, yung service contract.

asr-002807
04:11:15.700 --> 04:11:19.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: At least nabawasan ng 60 pesos yung, ah, pamasahe.

asr-002808
04:11:20.520 --> 04:11:23.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero yung sampung araw, okay na rin ninyo, at least.

asr-002809
04:11:23.800 --> 04:11:29.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: No? Ah, hindi kami umabot sa rally na yung mga pambot mag-angkla doon sa, ano.

asr-002810
04:11:29.600 --> 04:11:45.540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero sana, ah, maipare-consider ninyo, seriously, ah, lobby doon sa, sa DBM na maibalik yung, ah, 1 billion na subsidy para sa maritime.

asr-002811
04:11:46.020 --> 04:11:53.320
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi napaka-unfair po sa mga taga-isla na yung taga-mainland, since time immemorial,

asr-002812
04:11:53.900 --> 04:12:01.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: you enjoy every crisis, they, they always enjoy the subsidy, while yung mga nasa dagat, wala.

asr-002813
04:12:03.140 --> 04:12:12.140
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ah, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, ang DOTR po ay nagpapasalamat kay Congressman Dagoog for spearheading the maritime, ah, transport program.

asr-002814
04:12:12.300 --> 04:12:23.140
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Malaking bagay po ito na ma-i-sab, ma-i-dagdag, maka-i-dagdag po natin dito sa Kongreso ang nawala pong 1 billion para po sa maritime transport.

asr-002815
04:12:23.640 --> 04:12:25.640
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Na, for 2027.

asr-002816
04:12:27.500 --> 04:12:40.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, for the record, no, I am very frustrated and dismayed to the Department of Budget and Management na hindi nila sinama.

asr-002817
04:12:41.260 --> 04:12:46.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana walang taga-DBM na nakatira sa isla o ipinanganak sa isla.

asr-002818
04:12:46.280 --> 04:12:51.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kung mo ba nandito na sila nagtatrabaho sa Maynila, nakalimutan na nila na galing sila sa isla.

asr-002819
04:12:52.560 --> 04:12:53.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, yung mga kasalanan.

asr-002820
04:12:53.640 --> 04:12:57.980
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasamahan ko dito sa Berm, Hulo, Sulo, Tawi-Tawi, Basilan.

asr-002821
04:12:59.220 --> 04:13:00.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit? Hindi ba mga Pilipino yan?

asr-002822
04:13:01.700 --> 04:13:05.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, medyo may problema tayo sa DBM.

asr-002823
04:13:06.420 --> 04:13:17.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nandito naman siguro yung DBM because normally, DBM is represented sa lahat ng budget deliberation sa lahat ng agency.

asr-002824
04:13:17.200 --> 04:13:23.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana maiparating nyo kay Sekretary Kim na yung definition niya sa...

asr-002825
04:13:23.640 --> 04:13:28.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa DBM, dapat ang budget daw ay makatao.

asr-002826
04:13:28.460 --> 04:13:34.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi po makatao na ang isubsidize natin, land transportation lang, Sekretary Kim.

asr-002827
04:13:34.780 --> 04:13:38.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mali po yung definition mo sa DBM na dapat budget makatao.

asr-002828
04:13:39.020 --> 04:13:42.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi po makatao yung pinipili mo lang.

asr-002829
04:13:42.260 --> 04:13:51.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana ma-restore mo yung subsidy sa isla para hindi mo malabag yung equal protection ng ating konstitusyon.

asr-002830
04:13:52.320 --> 04:13:53.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi Pilipino...

asr-002831
04:13:53.640 --> 04:13:57.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mga Pilipino din po kami na taga Hulo, Sulo, Dinagat, Rumblon.

asr-002832
04:13:58.780 --> 04:14:00.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Samart, mga Pilipino din po kami.

asr-002833
04:14:00.880 --> 04:14:06.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, anyway, siguro malinaw yung naiparating natin sa DBM.

asr-002834
04:14:06.460 --> 04:14:08.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi po ito kasalaanan ni DOTR.

asr-002835
04:14:09.260 --> 04:14:10.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Last question na lang.

asr-002836
04:14:11.240 --> 04:14:16.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ganito kakapal yung question ko pero last question na lang ito.

asr-002837
04:14:16.300 --> 04:14:19.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Doon sa ano natin, sa air transportation.

asr-002838
04:14:21.380 --> 04:14:23.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: In one of the hearings, yata.

asr-002839
04:14:23.640 --> 04:14:39.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa Committee on Transportation, nabanggit ninyo na hindi na sinisingil ni CAB at saka ni CAB yung mga fees and charges sa ating mga airlines.

asr-002840
04:14:39.280 --> 04:14:39.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba yun?

asr-002841
04:14:49.740 --> 04:14:51.940
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-002842
04:14:52.040 --> 04:14:53.480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang tinatanong po nyo is the fuel surcharge.

asr-002843
04:14:53.640 --> 04:14:56.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Isa po yan.

asr-002844
04:14:57.580 --> 04:15:00.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero may mga fees pa yata yun na...

asr-002845
04:15:00.000 --> 04:15:16.280
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yes, may trigger mechanism po ang fuel surcharge kung nagkaroon po ng 20% increase dito po sa fuel prices, sa global fuel prices po bago po maka-charge po ng fuel surcharge.

asr-002846
04:15:16.380 --> 04:15:21.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, tinatanggal po siya, sinususpend pag maabot yung trigger?

asr-002847
04:15:21.560 --> 04:15:37.580
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sir, nagkakaroon po ng instead na 30-day price interval, nagiging 15 days po. So, twice a month po yung pagsukat po ng increase ng fuel prices po.

asr-002848
04:15:38.480 --> 04:15:39.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-002849
04:15:39.920 --> 04:15:57.800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: But there's an automatic mechanism na pagka bumaba below 100 ang Jet A1 fuel na price, bumaba po ng $100 per barrel, babalik po sa dating 30-day interval.

asr-002850
04:15:57.800 --> 04:16:11.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, para lang may idea ang ating mga air passengers, magkano po ba yung fuel surcharge na yan doon sa ticket natin?

asr-002851
04:16:11.080 --> 04:16:16.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Is that regardless sa layo ng destination or per ticket?

asr-002852
04:16:17.820 --> 04:16:21.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Magkano po at the average yung fuel surcharge?

asr-002853
04:16:21.560 --> 04:16:36.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, mayroon po sinusunod ang DOTR na matrix pero medyo mahaba po.

asr-002854
04:16:37.120 --> 04:16:46.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: But if the Distinguished Colleague will allow us to submit a written complete matrix po to your office and to this committee.

asr-002855
04:16:47.820 --> 04:16:48.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yes, please.

asr-002856
04:16:48.820 --> 04:16:50.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero yung pinakamataas.

asr-002857
04:16:51.560 --> 04:16:53.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pinakamataas at saka pinakamababa na lang.

asr-002858
04:16:53.620 --> 04:17:05.400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Nagre-range po ang domestic, Mr. Speaker and Distinguished Colleague, by domestic, nagre-range po between P457 to P1,336.

asr-002859
04:17:06.120 --> 04:17:14.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For international, nagre-range po sa P1,509 to P11,220.

asr-002860
04:17:15.440 --> 04:17:18.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay, thank you, Distinguished Sponsor. At least may idea na ako.

asr-002861
04:17:18.620 --> 04:17:20.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ang katanungan ko na lang.

asr-002862
04:17:21.560 --> 04:17:24.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tuwing isususpend yan, kung mag-trigger yun,

asr-002863
04:17:25.120 --> 04:17:37.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: papaano po may no-monitor ng CAB yung amount na yan na talagang nare-reflict na tatapyas doon sa binabayaran noong pasahero?

asr-002864
04:17:39.800 --> 04:17:44.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi baka nagsasayang tayo ng revenue ng gobyerno,

asr-002865
04:17:44.160 --> 04:17:51.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pero hindi rin naman napakinabangan, hindi natin na siguro na nag-reflect siya doon sa cost ng ticket.

asr-002866
04:17:51.560 --> 04:18:03.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mayroon po bang pamamaraan ang Civil Aeronautics Board na na-monitor yan na talagang tinatanggal yung amount na yan sa mga airline?

asr-002867
04:18:05.080 --> 04:18:16.560
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yung Civil Aeronautics Board po, Mr. Speaker, dear Distinguished Colleague, mayroon pong price monitoring system po silang sinusunod para sa increase or decrease of the airfare prices.

asr-002868
04:18:16.760 --> 04:18:17.279
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Online.

asr-002868-split-2
04:18:17.279 --> 04:18:19.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Online. Online. Nakikita nila.

asr-002869
04:18:19.080 --> 04:18:19.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Online po, oo.

asr-002870
04:18:19.680 --> 04:18:20.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, talagang...

asr-002871
04:18:21.560 --> 04:18:36.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sigurado si CAB na yung tinapyas nila dahil sinuspend noong time na yan ang ating fuel surcharge ay nare-reflict naman talaga sa ticket.

asr-002872
04:18:37.540 --> 04:18:43.660
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yes. The airlines will submit written report po sa CAB.

asr-002873
04:18:44.560 --> 04:18:45.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you.

asr-002874
04:18:45.020 --> 04:18:50.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, maraming salamat po sa ating kaibigan, sponsor.

asr-002875
04:18:51.560 --> 04:18:58.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: At sa DOTR, maraming salamat at umaga na ba? Ah, wala pa. Hindi pa pala.

asr-002876
04:18:59.180 --> 04:19:04.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, i-submit ko na lang itong ibang katanungan ko. Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002877
04:19:05.420 --> 04:19:06.970
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Speaker.

asr-002877-split-2
04:19:06.970 --> 04:19:08.320
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: [unclear] Sponsor, maraming salamat.

asr-002878
04:19:08.580 --> 04:19:15.380
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Sergio [unclear] Dagooc, [unclear] APEC Party List. Majority Leader, please.

asr-002879
04:19:15.640 --> 04:19:21.380
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Percy Cendaña of Akbayan

asr-002880
04:19:21.560 --> 04:19:23.860
Rep. Brian Poe: Party List to interpellate on the proposed budget.

asr-002881
04:19:24.500 --> 04:19:30.520
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The Akbayan Party List, Representative Percy Cendaña, you are now recognized, sir. Please proceed.

asr-002882
04:19:31.680 --> 04:19:39.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Ginong Speaker, at magandang gabi po sa ating distinguished sponsors at sa buong DOTR family.

asr-002883
04:19:40.160 --> 04:19:45.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bilisan ko na po yung mga tanong para hindi po tayo umagahin. Una pong mga tanong tukol po sa right-of-way.

asr-002884
04:19:45.700 --> 04:19:50.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magkano po ang current budget natin for the acquisition of right-of-way ng DOTR?

asr-002885
04:19:51.560 --> 04:20:05.780
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dito po sa NEP, bagamat insufficient po ang pondo, is 2.7 billion po for the North-South Commuter Railway alone.

asr-002886
04:20:07.580 --> 04:20:11.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, pag sinabi po natin insufficient, insufficient po by how much?

asr-002887
04:20:12.460 --> 04:20:19.560
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang total na kailangan po for 2027 is 30 billion, Mr. Speaker, Ginong Sponsor.

asr-002888
04:20:19.560 --> 04:20:20.260
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sponsor.

asr-002889
04:20:21.560 --> 04:20:27.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung ito po ay para sa North-South Commuter Railway lamang, paano po ang ating Metro Manila Subway Project?

asr-002890
04:20:29.680 --> 04:20:42.920
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kaya kulang rin po, distinguished colleague, kaya po humingi po ang DOTR ng karagdagang pondo for both North-South Commuter Railway and Metro Subway.

asr-002891
04:20:44.100 --> 04:20:48.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kumusta naman po sa MRT-7? Meron po ba tayong right-of-way requirement po po dito?

asr-002892
04:20:51.560 --> 04:20:57.820
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Pakiulit lang po, distinguished colleague.

asr-002893
04:20:58.400 --> 04:21:02.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May issues pa rin po ba tayo ng right-of-way for MRT-7, distinguished colleague?

asr-002894
04:21:02.360 --> 04:21:04.480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ah, wala na po, distinguished colleague.

asr-002895
04:21:05.080 --> 04:21:13.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ang pinag-uusapan po natin dito ay ang right-of-way acquisition for both the Metro Manila Subway Project at ang North-South Commuter Railway.

asr-002896
04:21:13.020 --> 04:21:20.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Given po na talagang malayo sa target amount natin, yung nag-reflect sa NEP, ano po ang implication nito in terms of our timelines?

asr-002897
04:21:21.560 --> 04:21:24.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Target completion dates, Mr. Speaker, ginoong sponsor?

asr-002898
04:21:25.700 --> 04:21:29.460
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Definitely, madi-delay po ang dalawang projects po.

asr-002899
04:21:30.260 --> 04:21:42.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor, may we know by how many months or years madi-delay ang dalawang proyektong ito dahil po sa kakulangan ng right-of-way acquisition allocation para po sa dalawang proyektong ito?

asr-002900
04:21:44.840 --> 04:21:51.020
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Distinguished colleague, may karagdagang po ang dalawang taon na delay po ang magiging efekto po nito.

asr-002901
04:21:51.560 --> 04:21:58.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ginoong speaker, talaga po nakababahala na dahil po sa kakulangan sa allocation for right-of-way acquisition,

asr-002902
04:21:59.020 --> 04:22:05.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: madi-delay po ng dalawang taon ang Metro Manila Subway Project at ang North-South Commuter Railway.

asr-002903
04:22:05.740 --> 04:22:13.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sigurado po ako na sa pag-narinig ito ng ating mga kababayan sa Central Luzon, sa Metro Manila at sa Southern Tagalog,

asr-002904
04:22:14.080 --> 04:22:19.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: talaga pong umaaray sila para malaman na dalawang taon ang magiging delay.

asr-002905
04:22:19.560 --> 04:22:21.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, given this two-year delay, kailan din?

asr-002906
04:22:21.560 --> 04:22:28.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kailan din po ang kumplisyon kung pag-uusapan po natin ang full operational mode ng dalawang proyektong ito?

asr-002907
04:22:28.560 --> 04:22:50.000
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: So, kung matadagdagan po ng hinihinging pondo ng DOTR,

asr-002908
04:22:50.000 --> 04:22:56.580
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: ay baka kaya pang mahabol sa same timeline po na nakaset, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002909
04:22:57.180 --> 04:23:02.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero kung hindi po madadagdagan, kailan po? Ano pong taon ang pinag-uusapan natin?

asr-002910
04:23:02.640 --> 04:23:08.360
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang estimate po ng DOTR, minimum of two years po ang may dadagdag, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002911
04:23:08.360 --> 04:23:11.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, anong taon po itong sinasabi natin na minimum of two years?

asr-002912
04:23:18.880 --> 04:23:19.360
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For...

asr-002913
04:23:19.360 --> 04:23:19.620
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For...

asr-002914
04:23:20.000 --> 04:23:27.440
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For the North-South Commuter Railway, from 2033 to 2035.

asr-002915
04:23:28.440 --> 04:23:38.080
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: For the Metro Subway, from 2031 to 2033, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002916
04:23:39.280 --> 04:23:47.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakalulungkot pong balita na kailangan pong maghirap, magtiis na ating mga kababayan ng dagdag pang dalawang taon

asr-002917
04:23:47.580 --> 04:23:49.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: dahil sa kakulangan po ng allocation.

asr-002918
04:23:50.000 --> 04:23:51.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For right-of-way acquisition.

asr-002919
04:23:53.520 --> 04:23:56.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Usapan pa rin po ng...

asr-002920
04:23:56.040 --> 04:23:59.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Binanggit ko kanina, time, opportunity, and dignity of our people.

asr-002921
04:24:00.120 --> 04:24:07.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi ito naman po talaga yung sinachampion ng departamento when it comes to developments in our transportation infrastructure system.

asr-002922
04:24:08.180 --> 04:24:13.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero meron na po kasi isang programa na gumagana at napapakinabangan ng milyong-milyong Pilipino.

asr-002923
04:24:13.500 --> 04:24:19.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero nakapagtataka po kung bakit ang nasa NEP ay zero ang budget para sa programang ito.

asr-002924
04:24:20.000 --> 04:24:23.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ito po ang EDSA Busway System.

asr-002925
04:24:23.700 --> 04:24:28.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kahapon lamang po, lumabas sa Manila Bulletin ang isang news article.

asr-002926
04:24:28.940 --> 04:24:29.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sinasabi,

asr-002927
04:24:30.260 --> 04:24:33.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Palace backs EDSA Busway funding request.

asr-002928
04:24:34.240 --> 04:24:37.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nagmula po mismo ang pahayag na ito sa Palace Press Officer.

asr-002929
04:24:38.100 --> 04:24:42.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero alam naman po natin na hindi ito ang nakareflex NEP.

asr-002930
04:24:42.560 --> 04:24:46.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Zero ang pondo ng EDSA Carousel for 2027.

asr-002931
04:24:46.000 --> 04:24:49.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sana po nag-uusap ang Palasyo at DBM

asr-002932
04:24:50.000 --> 04:24:51.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pagdating po sa usaping ito.

asr-002933
04:24:51.860 --> 04:24:56.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Initial budget hearing pa lang po nangungulit na ang akbaya na magbibigyan ng pondo ang programa.

asr-002934
04:24:57.180 --> 04:25:03.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At hindi natin tatantanan ang issue ito para sa 60 million na mananakay sa ating pong EDSA Bus Carousel.

asr-002935
04:25:04.680 --> 04:25:10.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Gusto lang po nating malaman, may update na po ba regarding the program's budget, Mr. Speaker Ginong Sponsor?

asr-002936
04:25:20.000 --> 04:25:32.740
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, for mentioning the EDSA Carousel Busway Project.

asr-002937
04:25:33.840 --> 04:25:41.680
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sumulat po ang DOTR na maibalik po ang 1.7 billion na pondo dito po sa Committee on Appropriations.

asr-002938
04:25:41.680 --> 04:25:50.120
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sana po matulungan ng Distinguished Colleague na maibalik po ang naturang pondo po for the EDSA Carousel.

asr-002939
04:25:51.200 --> 04:26:03.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, hindi lamang po ang mga commuter ang nananawagan para dito, pati po ang malakanyang mismo nagsabing suportado nito ang pagpopondo sa EDSA Carousel for 2027.

asr-002940
04:26:03.200 --> 04:26:09.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sana po, Mr. Speaker, i-prioritize ng Committee on Appropriations sa period of amendments ng GAB,

asr-002941
04:26:09.720 --> 04:26:11.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ang napakahalagang pasilidad na ito.

asr-002942
04:26:11.680 --> 04:26:16.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Why would we cancel a program that works and serves the people?

asr-002943
04:26:17.220 --> 04:26:25.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Why would we cancel a program that is helping a lot of commuters every day get to work and go home to their loved ones?

asr-002944
04:26:26.100 --> 04:26:33.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakalulungkot po na kinakailangan dumating tayo sa ganitong punto na ang malakanyang padadaanin sa press release ang panawagan niya dapat sa DBM.

asr-002945
04:26:34.340 --> 04:26:38.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So medyo nakakabahala po yung silos na nakikita natin.

asr-002946
04:26:38.600 --> 04:26:41.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo dun sa isa pang Zinero.

asr-002947
04:26:41.680 --> 04:26:44.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito naman po yung Service Contracting Program.

asr-002948
04:26:45.120 --> 04:26:53.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dahil po Zinero ang Service Contracting Program, ano po ang impact nito doon sa mga super at operator na sana po matutulungan ng programa?

asr-002949
04:26:53.960 --> 04:26:55.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, ganoon sponsor.

asr-002950
04:26:55.960 --> 04:26:59.400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Maraming salamat po sa katanungan ngayon, Mr. Speaker, Distigy Sponsor.

asr-002951
04:27:00.980 --> 04:27:08.820
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Napakalawak po ng epekto ng kawalan ng pondo para po sa SCP or Service Contracting Program.

asr-002952
04:27:09.420 --> 04:27:11.400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dahil po, tatlo pong...

asr-002953
04:27:11.680 --> 04:27:13.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Itong sektor ang apektado.

asr-002954
04:27:13.880 --> 04:27:23.700
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang una po ay ang operator po ng mga public utility vehicles or na part po ng SCP at ang mga tsyuper.

asr-002955
04:27:24.560 --> 04:27:33.700
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: At ang pinakamasaklap, pati po ang commuters ay apektado po sa kawalan po ng pondo dito sa SCP Program.

asr-002956
04:27:34.720 --> 04:27:40.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakalaga po nitong SCP Program para po sa tinatawag nating siguradong kita para sa mga tsyuper at operator

asr-002957
04:27:40.820 --> 04:27:44.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at siguradong sakay po para sa ating mga kababayang commuter.

asr-002958
04:27:44.380 --> 04:27:51.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo sa isa pang Zinero kasi triple zero po ang natanggap ng ating major public transportation programs.

asr-002959
04:27:52.280 --> 04:27:55.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po yung zero sa fuel subsidy program.

asr-002960
04:27:56.420 --> 04:27:59.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang mangyayari ngayon na zero po ang pondo nito next year?

asr-002961
04:28:00.200 --> 04:28:05.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At paano po natin matutulungan ang mga PUV sa kabila ng tumataas na presyo ng langis?

asr-002962
04:28:07.220 --> 04:28:09.940
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Speaker, Distigy Colleague.

asr-002963
04:28:10.820 --> 04:28:25.040
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dahil po sana dito sa fuel subsidy program ay maibubukod po natin ang epekto dito sa commuter dahil po isasubsidize sana ng DOTR ang increase ng presyo ng gasolina.

asr-002964
04:28:25.040 --> 04:28:39.100
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ngunit dahil po zero ang pondo ay mapipilitan pong humingi ng tulong ang operators at mga public utility drivers para po sa karagdagang pamasahe.

asr-002965
04:28:39.700 --> 04:28:40.040
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dito po sa...

asr-002966
04:28:40.820 --> 04:28:47.860
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: At pag nag-increase po ang pamasahe, natural po, maapektuhan po ang driving public.

asr-002967
04:28:48.320 --> 04:28:55.060
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yan po ang isang nakakalungkot pong epekto ng zero budget for the fuel subsidy.

asr-002968
04:28:55.700 --> 04:28:56.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002969
04:28:57.840 --> 04:29:06.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, kagalang-galang na sponsor, ito pong triple zero na ito ay triple zero na parang sampal sa ating mga mananakay na publiko.

asr-002970
04:29:06.100 --> 04:29:09.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Zeroing out the EDSA carousel program.

asr-002971
04:29:10.820 --> 04:29:17.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The fuel subsidy program would mean zero support for commuters in our transport sector.

asr-002972
04:29:17.820 --> 04:29:23.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakaraming kababayan po natin ang nakikiusap na ibalik ang budget ng mga programang ito.

asr-002973
04:29:23.520 --> 04:29:27.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We hope that their sentiments and struggles do not fall on deaf ears.

asr-002974
04:29:28.100 --> 04:29:36.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thus, Akbayan strongly manifests our support for the DOTR to restore the initially proposed budget for these very crucial programs.

asr-002975
04:29:36.700 --> 04:29:39.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Siguradong sakay para sa ating mga kababayang mananakay.

asr-002976
04:29:39.540 --> 04:29:43.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At siguradong kita para sa ating mga superot-operator.

asr-002977
04:29:44.020 --> 04:29:46.040
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po tayo sa mga bus operators.

asr-002978
04:29:46.300 --> 04:29:55.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kahapon lang po, naglabas din ang statement ang bus groups calling for the immediate lifting of LTRB's directive suspending the fare adjustment order.

asr-002979
04:29:56.540 --> 04:29:59.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Siyempre, nabahala po ang riding public kasi ibig sabihin ba nito?

asr-002980
04:30:00.000 --> 04:30:07.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ay pagtaas ng pamasahe na mga kababayan natin nagbubus po uwi ng probinsya para makapiling ang kanilang mga mahal sa buhay.

asr-002981
04:30:07.880 --> 04:30:11.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ayon po sa kanilang statement, this is not a threat to stop operations.

asr-002982
04:30:12.660 --> 04:30:16.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This is a notice that operations may soon become impossible.

asr-002983
04:30:17.580 --> 04:30:23.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Provincial and city bus companies are bleeding costs just to keep up with high operating expenses.

asr-002984
04:30:24.260 --> 04:30:28.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang tiguan ng DOTR dito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague?

asr-002985
04:30:28.280 --> 04:30:44.720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, ang sagot po rito ng DOTR ay ang continuous lobbying for the budget proposal to be funded for its implementation that shall directly benefit the public utility buses.

asr-002986
04:30:45.500 --> 04:31:05.120
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang isa pong possible na intervention po ay ang monthly amortization subsidy or the financial support, more or less P20,000 per month for the per modern unit.

asr-002987
04:31:05.120 --> 04:31:25.230
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, paano naman po yung mga provincial buses na nabanggit po natin na naglabas po ng statement kahapon? Kasi lubha pong nakababahala ito para sa mga kababayan natin na umuuwi ng probinsya para makapiling ang kanilang mga mahal sa buhay na mga nagtatrabaho po sa ating mga city centers.

asr-002989
04:31:29.430 --> 04:31:33.200
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: patuloy po, ongoing po, ang constant dialogue sa mga provincial buses.

asr-002990
04:31:33.960 --> 04:31:42.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sa kasalukuyan po, may binigay po ang DOTR na free toll fee sa mga provincial buses sa expressway po.

asr-002991
04:31:43.960 --> 04:31:51.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mayroon pa po ba tayong kailangang programa na i-put in place para tiyakin na mapuprotektahan po natin ang ating mga mananakay

asr-002992
04:31:51.540 --> 04:31:56.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mula po sa pagsirit pataas ng pamasahin ng ating mga biyahe pa uwi ng probinsya?

asr-002993
04:32:07.270 --> 04:32:22.550
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sa kasalukuyan po, tinatalakay dito sa dialogo ng DOTR at ng mga PUV operators na maisama po sa P450,000,000 fuel discount po na programa ng DOTR na more or less mga P12 per liter.

asr-002994
04:32:22.550 --> 04:32:24.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa kanyang po ba ay funded itong programang ito?

asr-002995
04:32:24.640 --> 04:32:28.880
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Funded po itong P450 million

asr-002996
04:32:28.880 --> 04:32:33.900
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: With the help of Department of Energy, Distinguished Colleague, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002997
04:32:34.220 --> 04:32:35.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Paano po sa 2027?

asr-002998
04:32:40.440 --> 04:32:51.200
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Depende na po yan kung matulungan po ng Kongreso na mapondohan ang fuel subsidy, Distinguished Colleague, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002999
04:32:52.200 --> 04:32:57.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, I cannot overemphasize the need to fund the fuel subsidy.

asr-003000
04:32:57.020 --> 04:33:08.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The fuel subsidy program, malaki po ang impact nito sa ating mga mananakay na natatakot po sa taas ng presyo ng anambilihan, may pagtaas pa ng presyo ng pamasahin at hindi pa tumataas ang sweldo.

asr-003001
04:33:09.040 --> 04:33:21.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mula po dito sa takot natin sa pagtaas ng presyo ng pamasahin, punta naman po tayo sa takot ng maraming mga kababayan natin everyday because of road safety of our commuters and pedestrian.

asr-003002
04:33:21.340 --> 04:33:26.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang datos po ng PSA, pinapakita na ang road crashes are the leading cause of death.

asr-003003
04:33:27.020 --> 04:33:30.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: For young Filipinos aged 15 to 29 years old.

asr-003004
04:33:31.300 --> 04:33:40.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Gusto po natin malaman mula sa DOTR, how is the Philippine Road Safety Action Plan or PRSAP being implemented by DOTR?

asr-003005
04:33:43.640 --> 04:33:51.480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, sa kasamaang palad, wala pong nakalaang pondo for the Road Safety Action Plan.

asr-003006
04:33:52.540 --> 04:33:56.620
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Pero may programa po sana ang naisip ng DOTR.

asr-003007
04:33:57.020 --> 04:34:19.240
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Na makipag-ugnayan sa DepEd or TESDA o sa mga private or public na eskwalahan na sa tamang edad, umpisahan na po natin na ma-educate ang mga kabataan sa road safety action plan.

asr-003008
04:34:19.240 --> 04:34:27.000
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Halimbawa po, bago po mag-apply ng student permit ng isang syudyante, medyo may seminar.

asr-003009
04:34:27.020 --> 04:34:44.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ang isang existing program ngayon ng DOTR ay nakapag-establish po ng Road Safety Action Park dito po sa Muntinlupa.

asr-003010
04:34:44.600 --> 04:34:55.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kung saan po, recently may mga 700 students na pupunta po dito sa parke at nakikita nila kung paano ang tamang...

asr-003011
04:34:57.020 --> 04:35:00.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: ...pag-educate sa mga kabataan.

asr-003012
04:35:01.000 --> 04:35:07.080
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Halimbawa po, dito po sa parke na ito, may mga traffic lights that makikita po nila kung ano ibig sabihin po.

asr-003013
04:35:07.840 --> 04:35:20.480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mga interactive na mga road safety mechanisms para po mainganyo po mga kabataan na mamulat ang tamang road safety action plan.

asr-003014
04:35:22.100 --> 04:35:25.300
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Ito pong nakakalagang parke ay mga more or less 20 million lang po.

asr-003015
04:35:25.300 --> 04:35:26.300
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: At sana po...

asr-003016
04:35:27.020 --> 04:35:29.360
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: ...simulan po ito sa ibang region.

asr-003017
04:35:29.640 --> 04:35:32.920
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Halimbawa po sa Cebu, sa Bohol at Iloilo.

asr-003018
04:35:34.240 --> 04:35:39.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, paano po ito masisimulan sa ibang region kung wala pong pondo?

asr-003019
04:35:39.340 --> 04:35:42.440
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Yun ang nakakalungkot po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003020
04:35:42.980 --> 04:35:50.700
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: At umaasa po ang DOTR sa tulong po ng Kongreso, maipondohan po ang ganitong programa ng DOTR.

asr-003021
04:35:51.380 --> 04:35:54.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Speaker, inuulit ko po.

asr-003022
04:35:55.480 --> 04:35:56.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Road crashes are the leading cause...

asr-003023
04:35:57.020 --> 04:36:00.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ...of death for young Filipinos 15 to 29 years old.

asr-003024
04:36:01.160 --> 04:36:05.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And yet, hindi mapondohan ang Philippine Road Safety Action Plan.

asr-003025
04:36:06.820 --> 04:36:09.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakababagabag, nakakagalit, at nakakatakot.

asr-003026
04:36:10.740 --> 04:36:14.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami pong salamat sa ating pong distinguished sponsor.

asr-003027
