asr-003163
04:43:52.900 --> 04:43:54.520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: 64.66%.

asr-003164
04:43:54.520 --> 04:43:58.780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Okay. Ito is with regards to the road right of way.

