Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Good Sponsor, I will now proceed with some questions regarding Marina's role in maritime safety.

asr-003834
05:15:38.580 --> 05:15:48.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Under the 2027 NEP, Marina has a P904 million budget for the Maritime Industry Regulatory and Supervision Program.

asr-003835
05:15:49.640 --> 05:15:55.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Sponsor, maari bang i-elaborate kung ano-ano ang mga sakop ng programang ito?

asr-003836
05:15:55.740 --> 05:15:58.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasama ba rito ang patungkol sa

asr-003837
05:15:58.300 --> 05:16:00.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: vessel safety and inspection?

asr-003838
05:16:01.680 --> 05:16:03.940
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003839
05:16:04.760 --> 05:16:09.240
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: ang P904 million over ship and shipyard registration,

asr-003840
05:16:10.380 --> 05:16:13.080
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: safe areas documentation and certification,

asr-003841
05:16:14.220 --> 05:16:19.020
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: accreditation and monitoring of safe areas education and training programs

asr-003842
05:16:19.020 --> 05:16:25.080
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: in ship safety regulatory and enforcement, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003843
05:16:25.780 --> 05:16:28.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: If vessel safety and inspection,

asr-003844
05:16:28.300 --> 05:16:32.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: inspection is included, how much is the specific allocation po?

asr-003845
05:16:33.280 --> 05:16:42.060
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, total of 61.268 million for ship inspection and enforcement.

asr-003846
05:16:42.740 --> 05:16:44.400
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003847
05:16:45.240 --> 05:16:55.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished Sponsor, as of date, ilang vessels ang na-deny ng certification o na-suspend dahil sa safety deficiencies?

asr-003848
05:16:55.220 --> 05:16:58.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, MARINA will provide

asr-003849
05:16:58.300 --> 05:17:04.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: information as well as require the regional offices to submit data to your office.

asr-003850
05:17:04.300 --> 05:17:05.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-003851
05:17:05.360 --> 05:17:13.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can Marina provide data regarding this including the particular violations that resulted in denial or suspension?

asr-003852
05:17:14.180 --> 05:17:16.340
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, the same.

asr-003853
05:17:16.960 --> 05:17:19.660
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: MARINA will also provide information as well as require

asr-003854
05:17:20.680 --> 05:17:22.840
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: the regional offices to submit the data also.

asr-003855
05:17:23.480 --> 05:17:24.000
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker.

asr-003856
05:17:25.580 --> 05:17:28.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003857
05:17:28.300 --> 05:17:35.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, dahil nabanggit ko na ang tungkol sa mga safety deficiencies,

asr-003858
05:17:36.280 --> 05:17:47.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: dadako naman ako sa MV June Astor Tragedy kung saan 77, ulitin ko po, 77 na ang naitalang namatay.

asr-003859
05:17:48.580 --> 05:17:56.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Recently, it was reported that the ship's captain voluntarily surfaced and appeared before the authorities.

asr-003860
05:17:56.260 --> 05:17:58.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa mga press statements din,

asr-003861
05:17:58.300 --> 05:18:04.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nabanggit na Department of Transportation mismo ang nag-i-investigate ng nasabing kaso.

asr-003862
05:18:05.380 --> 05:18:13.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Given this development, may formal findings na po ba ang DOTR kung ano ang rason o sanhi ng trahedya?

asr-003863
05:18:14.880 --> 05:18:16.680
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003864
05:18:17.480 --> 05:18:25.500
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Interim Marine Casualty Investigation is available but final report is expected to be completed by end of this month.

asr-003865
05:18:26.180 --> 05:18:28.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Since wala pa pong final,

asr-003866
05:18:28.300 --> 05:18:34.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano po kaya ang timeline sa investigation at overall resolution ng case?

asr-003867
05:18:35.380 --> 05:18:37.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003868
05:18:38.220 --> 05:18:46.520
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: ang safety certificate ng dalawang operating vessel ng Atienza Ferries were suspended.

asr-003869
05:18:47.600 --> 05:18:51.600
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thus, they are not allowed to operate, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003870
05:18:52.380 --> 05:18:53.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-003871
05:18:53.300 --> 05:18:57.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May suspension o revocation na po ba ang...

asr-003872
05:18:58.300 --> 05:19:08.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: let's say licenses or permits na ginawa ang marina kaugnay sa trahedya kasama ang iba pa nilang mga barko kung sakaling mayroon man?

asr-003873
05:19:12.140 --> 05:19:15.180
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mayroon na po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003874
05:19:16.660 --> 05:19:26.220
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Ang dalawang operating vessel ng Atienza Ferries ay suspended na po sa ngayon at hindi na po sila hinahayaang makapaglayag.

asr-003875
05:19:27.420 --> 05:19:28.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-003876
05:19:28.300 --> 05:19:42.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor, maaari bang ipaliwanag bakit hindi grinound immediately ang fleet ng Atienza Interisland Ferries Incorporated na operator ng MV June Aster habang ongoing ang investigation?

asr-003877
05:19:42.860 --> 05:19:44.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003878
05:19:45.720 --> 05:19:55.980
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: ang iba pong operating na vessel ng Atienza were subjected to verification, inspection, and subsequently safety certificate were suspended.

asr-003879
05:19:55.980 --> 05:19:56.980
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: And now...

asr-003880
05:19:58.300 --> 05:19:59.640
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: not operating.

asr-003881
05:20:00.260 --> 05:20:00.740
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Number two,

asr-003882
05:20:01.600 --> 05:20:09.400
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: marina has no existing policy on fleet suspension or walang automatic suspension ng lahat ng barko.

asr-003883
05:20:10.500 --> 05:20:16.380
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Suspension depends on the result of compliance verification per vessel.

asr-003884
05:20:17.060 --> 05:20:17.760
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: And number three,

asr-003885
05:20:18.540 --> 05:20:22.180
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: this is the first very serious incident involving Atienza ships.

asr-003886
05:20:22.480 --> 05:20:24.700
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003887
05:20:25.220 --> 05:20:26.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat.

asr-003888
05:20:26.020 --> 05:20:27.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa pagklaro po dito, no?

asr-003889
05:20:28.300 --> 05:20:34.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ba ang mga requisites bago mag-ground ang fleet ng isang shipping company or operator?

asr-003890
05:20:35.040 --> 05:20:36.620
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003891
05:20:37.500 --> 05:20:38.840
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Number one,

asr-003892
05:20:39.720 --> 05:20:53.260
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: fleet suspension or grounding will be implemented if the safety management system of the company is found to be uncompliant with international safety management code.

asr-003893
05:20:54.080 --> 05:20:55.980
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Number two, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003894
05:20:56.820 --> 05:20:57.620
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: major safety deficiencies,

asr-003895
05:20:58.300 --> 05:21:01.700
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: on all vessels of all the particular company,

asr-003896
05:21:02.900 --> 05:21:09.460
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: major deficiencies are identified in the marina ship safety survey manual.

asr-003897
05:21:10.200 --> 05:21:11.520
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003898
05:21:11.960 --> 05:21:15.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As a follow-up po, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003899
05:21:15.300 --> 05:21:20.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kung hindi pwedeng i-ground ang fleet ng isang company na involved sa isang shipping tragedy,

asr-003900
05:21:20.380 --> 05:21:27.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano ang hakbang na ginagawa ng DOTR at marina to ensure na ang remaining vessels ng isang shipping company,

asr-003901
05:21:28.300 --> 05:21:29.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay seaworthy?

asr-003902
05:21:30.860 --> 05:21:32.480
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003903
05:21:33.160 --> 05:21:38.120
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: magkakandak po ng safety verification inspection of the company's vessel.

asr-003904
05:21:38.500 --> 05:21:39.780
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003905
05:21:40.560 --> 05:21:46.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po ang immediate reforms na ipapatupad ng marina matapos ang trahedyang ito?

asr-003906
05:21:47.800 --> 05:21:50.020
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003907
05:21:50.920 --> 05:21:54.560
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: number one, reiteration of the safety protocols,

asr-003908
05:21:55.240 --> 05:21:55.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: particularly,

asr-003909
05:21:55.300 --> 05:21:57.300
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: the conduct of emergency,

asr-003910
05:21:58.300 --> 05:22:00.720
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: emergency readiness evaluation.

asr-003911
05:22:01.820 --> 05:22:02.320
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Number two,

asr-003912
05:22:03.140 --> 05:22:09.700
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: fast-track the issuance of rules on the carriage of EVs and HEVs.

asr-003913
05:22:10.500 --> 05:22:12.080
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003914
05:22:13.000 --> 05:22:20.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Under the 2027 NEP for the Maritime Industry Promotion and Development Program,

asr-003915
05:22:20.160 --> 05:22:27.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: target ng marina na magkaroon ng seven policies formulated, updated, issued,

asr-003916
05:22:27.900 --> 05:22:28.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and distributed.

asr-003917
05:22:28.300 --> 05:22:34.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor, can marina confirm if the target has been reached?

asr-003918
05:22:36.080 --> 05:22:38.000
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Yes po, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-003919
05:22:38.620 --> 05:22:44.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano-ano rin po ang mga policies na pinormulate at in-update ng marina sa taong ito?

asr-003920
05:22:48.220 --> 05:22:51.600
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Meron po tatlo tungkol po sa SECW.

asr-003921
05:22:55.020 --> 05:22:58.140
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Maritime Education and Training ng mga seafarers.

asr-003923
05:23:01.320 --> 05:23:03.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-003924
05:23:04.320 --> 05:23:10.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: this representation would like to request a copy of all the data related to this policy, po.

asr-003925
05:23:11.620 --> 05:23:18.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can the DOTR and Marina commit to provide them before we move to the second reading of the GAA?

asr-003926
05:23:19.020 --> 05:23:20.760
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003927
05:23:21.240 --> 05:23:25.140
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Marina will submit the necessary document to your office.

asr-003928
05:23:25.140 --> 05:23:26.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-003929
05:23:27.260 --> 05:23:28.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Good sponsor,

asr-003930
05:23:28.140 --> 05:23:34.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na-reflect na ba or nakapag-reflect na ba sa mga policies na ito

asr-003931
05:23:34.660 --> 05:23:40.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang mga dapat sinupin base sa mga naging aral ng MV

asr-003932
05:23:40.520 --> 05:23:46.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Trisha Kerstin 3 Tragedy at MV June Aster Tragedy na parehas nangyari ngayong taon?

asr-003933
05:23:52.820 --> 05:23:55.040
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003934
05:23:55.320 --> 05:23:57.880
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: lahat ng ito po ay nakita.

asr-003935
05:23:58.140 --> 05:24:04.900
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: At isa po sa counter-measure na ginawa ng ahensya ay tinaasan po ang fines and penalties

asr-003936
05:24:04.900 --> 05:24:07.980
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: pag-ating po sa mga violation ng mga kumpanya,

asr-003937
05:24:08.400 --> 05:24:11.400
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: nag-violate po pag-ating po sa mga nangyaring aksidente o insidente.

asr-003938
05:24:12.660 --> 05:24:19.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nagsasagawa ba ang Marina ng stakeholders consultation bago maglabas ng bagong policies?

asr-003939
05:24:19.020 --> 05:24:28.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: O ito ay para matiyak na ang reforms ay grounded sa aktwal na karanasan ng industriya at nangyari?

asr-003940
05:24:28.140 --> 05:24:33.700
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, nagsasagawa po sila lagi.

asr-003941
05:24:36.540 --> 05:24:39.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Finally, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-003942
05:24:39.900 --> 05:24:45.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: given repeated tragedies and the billions allocated for regulation and supervision,

asr-003943
05:24:45.980 --> 05:24:52.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: how can Marina assure the Filipino people that its mandate will translate into real safety outcomes,

asr-003944
05:24:53.060 --> 05:24:57.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: not just paper compliance and post-incident reforms?

asr-003945
05:24:58.140 --> 05:25:00.460
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-003946
05:25:01.200 --> 05:25:12.680
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: ang Marina ay nagbibigay ng mahigpit na patakaran at nagbibigay ng mahigpit na at seryosong penalties

asr-003947
05:25:12.680 --> 05:25:19.060
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: sa lahat na magba-violate ng safety ng mga mananakay natin.

asr-003948
05:25:19.980 --> 05:25:26.420
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: At nagpo-focus sila sa mga drills at ang actual na implementation ay pinatutupad nila

asr-003949
05:25:26.420 --> 05:25:28.020
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: sa mga kumpanya ng barco at sa mga mananakay.

asr-003950
05:25:28.140 --> 05:25:37.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana nga po, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, ipagpatuloy natin kung ganito nga po talaga ang kanilang ginagawa

asr-003951
05:25:37.100 --> 05:25:45.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at sana maging lesson na rin po sa Marina yung naging dalawang trahedya ngayong taon sa ating bansa.

asr-003952
05:25:46.080 --> 05:25:52.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po basta-basta yung isang pamilya na mawalan po ng kanyang minamahal sa buhay.

asr-003953
05:25:52.560 --> 05:25:57.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Imagine nyo po, 77 lives, tapos iba pa yung sa MB3 siya, Kirsten 3.

asr-003954
05:25:58.140 --> 05:26:01.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In closing, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-003955
05:26:01.860 --> 05:26:07.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: karapatan ng bawat manggagawa, magulang at batang sumasakay sa mga barco at ferry

asr-003956
05:26:07.800 --> 05:26:12.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang marating ang kanilang destinasyon ng ligtas at buhay.

asr-003957
05:26:13.160 --> 05:26:17.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Basic na sana ang safety at hindi kailangan pang pakiusapan

asr-003958
05:26:17.480 --> 05:26:21.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kada umakyat sa barco ang ating mga kababayan.

asr-003959
05:26:24.300 --> 05:26:27.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pinagkatiwala nila ang kanilang buhay sa mga passenger lines

asr-003960
05:26:28.140 --> 05:26:34.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: responsibilidad ngayon ng DOTR na isigurong hindi binabarat, hindi tinitipid

asr-003961
05:26:34.780 --> 05:26:42.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at hindi binibigo ang ating mga kababayan ng mga passenger companies na kumikita ng milyon-milyon.

asr-003962
05:26:43.280 --> 05:26:50.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Panahon na upang tiyakin ng Marina at ng DOTR na bawat pisong inilalaan natin

asr-003963
05:26:50.620 --> 05:26:57.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay magbubunga ng tunay at kongkretong proteksyon para sa bawat pamilyang Pilipino.

asr-003964
05:26:57.320 --> 05:26:57.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat.

asr-003965
05:26:58.140 --> 05:27:02.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-003966
05:27:02.520 --> 05:27:04.620
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you, the Honorable Ismula, Majority Leader.

asr-003967
05:27:05.300 --> 05:27:12.460
Rep. Brian Poe: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Vice Chair, Renante Arogancia,

asr-003968
05:27:12.780 --> 05:27:19.220
Rep. Brian Poe: Vice Chairperson of the Committee on Appropriations to also sponsor the budget of the Department of Transportation

asr-003969
05:27:19.220 --> 05:27:21.680
Rep. Brian Poe: and its attached agencies and corporations.

asr-003970
05:27:21.820 --> 05:27:27.680
Rep. Brian Poe: With that being said, Mr. Speaker, I'd also like to move that we recognize the Honorable

asr-003971
05:27:28.140 --> 05:27:34.820
Rep. Brian Poe: The Honorable Sarah Ilago from Party List, Gabriela Women's Party List to Interpolate the Proposed Budget.

asr-003972
05:27:36.620 --> 05:27:41.720
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The Honorable Ilago is recognized. Please proceed.

asr-003973
05:27:43.760 --> 05:27:46.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

asr-003974
05:27:47.060 --> 05:27:55.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natanggap ng aming office ang status report ng relocation sites para sa project affected persons ng railway projects ng DOTR.

asr-003975
05:27:55.720 --> 05:28:05.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At batay sa kanilang ulat, may ipapatayo na 27,333 units para sa mga maapektuhan.

asr-003976
05:28:06.740 --> 05:28:17.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin po ba nito, nasa 27,333 households din ang ating project affected household sa lahat ng mga railway projects?

asr-003977
05:28:18.780 --> 05:28:20.960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distribute Colleague, tama po kayo.

asr-003978
05:28:22.380 --> 05:28:24.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat. At batay din sa inyong...

asr-003979
05:28:25.720 --> 05:28:34.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Na ibigay na ulat, may mga proyekto na may phase 2 na naghihintay pa ng availability of funds.

asr-003980
05:28:34.200 --> 05:28:41.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At marami dito ay sakop ng mga proyekto na ang partner agency ninyo ay ang National Housing Authority.

asr-003981
05:28:42.660 --> 05:28:51.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba natin malaman mula sa ating distinguished sponsor kung paano maapektuhan ang bilis o bagal ng pag-relocate,

asr-003982
05:28:52.200 --> 05:28:55.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kawalan ng pondo ng mga relocation?

asr-003983
05:28:55.720 --> 05:28:56.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa mga location site na ito.

asr-003984
05:28:57.540 --> 05:29:10.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na, dito po sa South Long Haul Project, meron po tayong apat doon sa anim na mga proyekto

asr-003985
05:29:10.820 --> 05:29:18.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang naghihintay pa ng availability ng funds para sa pagtatapos nito para sa phase 2 ng mga proyekto na ito.

asr-003986
05:29:21.880 --> 05:29:25.040
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distribute Colleague, tama po kayo.

asr-003987
05:29:25.040 --> 05:29:30.020
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: May mga maapektuhan po tayo dahil po doon sa availability ng fund.

asr-003988
05:29:30.720 --> 05:29:43.440
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Pero ang DOTR po ay hindi po gumagalaw ng isang proyekto kung wala pong malinaw na paglilipatan ang ating mga kababayan.

asr-003989
05:29:45.460 --> 05:29:47.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Aguinoong Speaker.

asr-003990
05:29:47.940 --> 05:29:53.940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nananawagan din po tayo bilang pangunahin natin na public housing production agency.

asr-003991
05:29:55.040 --> 05:29:55.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang NHA.

asr-003992
05:29:56.080 --> 05:29:58.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakalaki din po ng kaltas sa kanilang pondo.

asr-003993
05:29:58.860 --> 05:30:00.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marami doon sa kanilang mga...

asr-003994
05:30:00.000 --> 05:30:04.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang pangangailangan ay hindi mapupondohan para sa susunod na taon,

asr-003995
05:30:04.960 --> 05:30:11.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nararapat lang na bigyan natin ng prioridad ang mas malaking pondo para sa National Housing Authority,

asr-003996
05:30:11.560 --> 05:30:18.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na po sa maraming na lista ng DOTR na mga proyekto,

asr-003997
05:30:18.580 --> 05:30:24.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: marami hindi matatapos kung wala po ang pondo ng kanilang partner agency tulad ng NHA.

asr-003998
05:30:24.380 --> 05:30:30.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, nabanggit din ng DOTR sa budget briefing dito sa House of Representatives

asr-003999
05:30:30.120 --> 05:30:38.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ang inyong aawardan ng mga project-affected persons ay meron ding suporta sa edukasyon,

asr-004000
05:30:39.160 --> 05:30:45.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa pabahay, sa utilities ng mga nailipat na mga pamilya at mga bata.

asr-004001
05:30:45.820 --> 05:30:54.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba natin malaman, halimbawa, lahat ba nitong 11.28% na naawardan na po ng mga houses?

asr-004002
05:30:54.380 --> 05:30:59.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa mga housing units, lahat ng kanilang nilipatan, kumpleto ba ng pasilidad para sa paaralan?

asr-004003
05:31:01.160 --> 05:31:06.340
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, kumpleto po sila ng pasilidad para po sa kanilang pangailangan.

asr-004004
05:31:07.760 --> 05:31:14.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung gayon, Mr. Speaker, hihingi na rin po natin yung detalye na ma-isumite na rin sa ating Committee on Appropriations

asr-004005
05:31:14.440 --> 05:31:20.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa representasyon na ito, yung detalye ng availability ng educational facilities.

asr-004006
05:31:20.820 --> 05:31:24.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Gayon din, sinabi nyo, meron din kayong support for livelihoods.

asr-004007
05:31:24.380 --> 05:31:31.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mayroon din supporta para matiyak na meron talagang utilities sa mga lugar na yan.

asr-004008
05:31:31.840 --> 05:31:36.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yan po ay pangkaraniwan, madalas na problema sa maraming relocation site.

asr-004009
05:31:36.820 --> 05:31:43.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumpleto po ang bahay na award na pero walang kuryente, walang tubig at wala rin kabuhayan.

asr-004010
05:31:44.200 --> 05:31:48.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya yung nangyayari, yung mga dapat ay lilipat na ay hindi po agad makalipat.

asr-004011
05:31:48.780 --> 05:31:52.080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ayan po ang hihingi na detalye ng representasyon na ito.

asr-004012
05:31:52.080 --> 05:31:53.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marami po yung mga proyekto.

asr-004013
05:31:54.380 --> 05:32:01.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kunti na lang, meron din kayong, sinabi sa budget briefing na meron kayong nasa 10,000 to 15,000 per family

asr-004014
05:32:01.160 --> 05:32:04.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na assistance na binibigay.

asr-004015
05:32:04.620 --> 05:32:10.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede ko po bang malaman kung saan nyo kinukuha yung particular financial assistance na ito

asr-004016
05:32:10.160 --> 05:32:12.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa project affected persons?

asr-004017
05:32:13.040 --> 05:32:14.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi nyo po ito sa budget briefing.

asr-004018
05:32:18.740 --> 05:32:23.520
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, galing po ito sa Right of Way Fund

asr-004019
05:32:23.520 --> 05:32:27.260
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: at sa GOP funds.

asr-004020
05:32:28.740 --> 05:32:32.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, meron din bang pondo para sa mga child development centers?

asr-004021
05:32:33.240 --> 05:32:35.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Oo, nandyan po yung mga malapit na mga paaralan.

asr-004022
05:32:36.020 --> 05:32:41.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero paano po yung mga bata na nasa edad na para po sa ating mga daycare?

asr-004023
05:32:41.740 --> 05:32:47.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po bang mga relocation sites ay meron ding itatayo o naitayo na child development centers?

asr-004024
05:32:47.640 --> 05:32:51.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lahat po ba ng mga relocation sites ay maasahan natin na meron ito?

asr-004025
05:32:51.420 --> 05:32:53.320
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Lahat po ito ay meron po silang fund.

asr-004026
05:32:53.520 --> 05:32:56.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

asr-004027
05:32:56.540 --> 05:33:00.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At yung binigay po sa atin na ulat, ang nakalagay lang ay mga syudad,

asr-004028
05:33:00.920 --> 05:33:08.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga general, mas hindi po ganoon kadetalyado yung mga addresses,

asr-004029
05:33:08.640 --> 05:33:12.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mismong location, na is po sana natin macheck din.

asr-004030
05:33:12.340 --> 05:33:18.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa, kung malapit ba sila dun sa previous nila na mga tahanan.

asr-004031
05:33:19.640 --> 05:33:23.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang atin po kasing panawagan dito sa ating kapulungan,

asr-004033
05:33:23.500 --> 05:33:28.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat talaga first recourse sa kahit anong relocation, resettlement,

asr-004034
05:33:28.100 --> 05:33:33.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dapat ka hindi resettlement kasi dapat hindi po malayo dun sa kanilang dati na tinitirahan.

asr-004035
05:33:34.420 --> 05:33:38.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung on-site relocation, yung on-site na lilipatan, mas mainam,

asr-004036
05:33:39.180 --> 05:33:44.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para hindi po ganoon ka maiistorbo yung pag-aaral, yung trabaho, yung kabuhayan

asr-004037
05:33:44.500 --> 05:33:49.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga kababayan na gusto rin naman ng pag-unlad,

asr-004038
05:33:49.920 --> 05:33:53.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pero dapat nga ay kasama sila doon sa mga proyekto.

asr-004039
05:33:53.500 --> 05:33:59.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, ginuong speaker, ang DOTR ay miyembro ng Uplift Committee.

asr-004040
05:34:00.900 --> 05:34:06.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nitong linggo lang, binalitaan tayo ng DOE na sila ay nagpasa na ng certification

asr-004041
05:34:06.740 --> 05:34:14.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ating economic managers na lumagpas na, umabot na dun sa threshold ng 80 USD,

asr-004042
05:34:15.880 --> 05:34:23.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dubai crude oil price, na dapat trigger, para ko patulak ang paggamit,

asr-004043
05:34:23.500 --> 05:34:32.440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang emergency powers ng Presidente sa pagsususpindi, pagbabawas ng excise tax rates sa mga petroleum products.

asr-004044
05:34:32.780 --> 05:34:38.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kahapon, nag-anunsyo na may suspension, pero para lang sa LPG at kerosene.

asr-004045
05:34:38.580 --> 05:34:44.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari ba nating malaman kung ano ang recommendation ng DOTR sa Uplift Committee

asr-004046
05:34:44.160 --> 05:34:50.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa pagsususpindi, pagbabawas ng excise tax sa lahat ng petroleum products?

asr-004047
05:34:52.380 --> 05:34:53.420
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker,

asr-004048
05:34:53.500 --> 05:35:03.680
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Colleague, wala po kaming recommendation kasi ito po ay beyond our mandate.

asr-004049
05:35:06.080 --> 05:35:12.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, di po ba ang kayo ay isinama bilang miyembro ng Uplift Committee

asr-004050
05:35:12.140 --> 05:35:19.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa visa po ng executive order na may kinalaman din sa pagdedelara State of National Energy Emergency

asr-004051
05:35:19.320 --> 05:35:23.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil nakita na po sa pagpaplano, sa pagdedesign,

asr-004052
05:35:23.500 --> 05:35:32.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating pagtugon sa pagsirit ng presyo ng langis ay lubos na apektado ang sektor ng transportasyon.

asr-004053
05:35:33.480 --> 05:35:35.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bakit po wala po kayong rekomendasyon?

asr-004054
05:35:36.520 --> 05:35:42.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kayo po ay nilagay doon sa committee para nga po malaman ano ba yung impact sa transport sector,

asr-004055
05:35:42.700 --> 05:35:49.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ilan bang mga drivers, operators, mga kumpanya, yung lubos na umaaray dahil sa taas ng presyo ng langis.

asr-004056
05:35:49.480 --> 05:35:52.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat may malinaw po na rekomendasyon ng DOTR.

asr-004057
05:35:53.500 --> 05:36:00.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay mismo umuupo doon sa mga pinapatawag na pagpupulong ng napakahalaga na committee na ito.

asr-004058
05:36:01.480 --> 05:36:03.360
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague,

asr-004059
05:36:03.880 --> 05:36:10.960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: ang DOTR po ay limitado po ang aming kakayanan pagdating po sa inyo pong nabanggit

asr-004060
05:36:10.960 --> 05:36:15.280
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: dahil kami po ay nakafocus po sa mga mananakay natin at sa ating transport sector.

asr-004061
05:36:15.860 --> 05:36:21.240
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Pagdating po doon po sa mga taxes, ito po ay labas sa aming pong mandato.

asr-004062
05:36:21.240 --> 05:36:26.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero ginong Speaker, tama po ba na kapag kayo po ay nagsalita,

asr-004063
05:36:26.620 --> 05:36:32.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: halimbawa na daan-daan po natin ang mga duty drivers na naglulunsad ng transport strike

asr-004064
05:36:32.880 --> 05:36:37.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para manawagan na dapat mas mapababa yung presyo ng langis,

asr-004065
05:36:37.620 --> 05:36:41.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na hindi sapat ang mga fuel subsidies, na maraming nangangailangan,

asr-004066
05:36:42.520 --> 05:36:49.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na dapat mas malawak yung coverage ng anumang mga assistance na ating pinapanawagan.

asr-004067
05:36:49.240 --> 05:36:49.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat.

asr-004070
05:36:50.520 --> 05:36:54.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang DOTR ang aasahan na dapat magsalita dyan.

asr-004071
05:36:54.760 --> 05:36:59.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Doon po sa kanina pa binabanggit ng ating mga kasamahan na umaaray din

asr-004072
05:36:59.480 --> 05:37:04.680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang mga provincial at city buses pagdating sa kaas ng presyo ng langis

asr-004073
05:37:04.680 --> 05:37:09.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ito ay nasa 40 to 60 percent ng cost ng kanilang operations,

asr-004074
05:37:10.000 --> 05:37:14.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po ba gagalaw at hindi po ba dapat nagsasalita pangunahin ang DOTR

asr-004075
05:37:14.960 --> 05:37:19.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ganitong kalagayan sa loob ng napakahalaga ng committee na ito.

asr-004076
05:37:19.500 --> 05:37:24.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin lang, Mr. Speaker, hindi po dapat hayaan na lang ng DOTR.

asr-004077
05:37:25.260 --> 05:37:32.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa ang DOE na nag-certify na ang Department of Finance ang magdesisyon tungkol dito sa usapin ng buwis.

asr-004078
05:37:33.420 --> 05:37:41.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat sila mismo ang magkaroon ng malinaw na posisyon tindig para po magkaroon ng paggamit ng emergency power

asr-004079
05:37:41.960 --> 05:37:48.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para po pansamantala muna na masuspindi ang excise tax, lalong-lalo na po sa diesel at gasolina.

asr-004080
05:37:48.320 --> 05:37:54.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nang galing din dito, Mr. Speaker, ang Department of Agriculture at sila po malinaw ang kanilang posisyon

asr-004081
05:37:54.980 --> 05:38:03.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bilang member din ng uplift na dapat nga hindi lang excise taxes sa oil ang ating tatanggalin,

asr-004082
05:38:03.640 --> 05:38:11.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang ating pansamantalang babawasan, dapat nga pag-aralan din ng DOF ang pagtatanggal ng 12 percent na value-added tax.

asr-004083
05:38:11.560 --> 05:38:17.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya dapat po kung wala pa na nakakabahala po na walang malinaw,

asr-004084
05:38:18.320 --> 05:38:25.100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sabay na posisyon, hinahamon po natin ang DOTR dapat kayo po mismo na tumindig,

asr-004085
05:38:25.300 --> 05:38:33.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kasama ng maraming nananawagan ngayon, dapat agaran na aksyonan ang pagpapababa ng presyo ng langis.

asr-004086
05:38:34.180 --> 05:38:44.900
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, Mr. Colleague, ang DOTR po ay kaisan nyo dun po sa inyong panawagan na mapababa natin ang presyo po ng ating pong langis.

asr-004087
05:38:45.080 --> 05:38:48.180
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Pero dun po sa usapin pag-ating po sa buwis.

asr-004088
05:38:48.320 --> 05:39:02.680
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: At hindi po kaya ng mandato ng DOTR na diktahan o mag-gumawa ng isang bagay na hindi po abot dun po sa kakayanan ng DOTR.

asr-004089
05:39:03.260 --> 05:39:17.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, hindi po natin hinihingi na yung DOTR ang mag-suspende ng excise tax sa petroleum products o mag-suspende ng koleksyon ng vat.

asr-004090
05:39:17.020 --> 05:39:17.880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi malinaw po.

asr-004091
05:39:18.320 --> 05:39:20.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sabi nyo wala po yan sa kapangyarihan ng DOTR.

asr-004092
05:39:20.860 --> 05:39:34.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero bilang boses ng sektor ng transportasyon sa loob ng Uplift Committee, makakatulong po sa pagkumbinse, sa paghamon, sa pagsingil din po sa ating economic managers

asr-004093
05:39:34.640 --> 05:39:42.160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na huwag naman po sanang maipasan lahat sa taong bayan na lang yung bigat po ng taas ng presyo ng langis.

asr-004094
05:39:42.160 --> 05:39:47.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa bahagi din po ng pamahalaan, kailangan sa atin din po.

asr-004095
05:39:48.320 --> 05:39:50.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bahagi ng pagsasakripisyo.

asr-004096
05:39:50.340 --> 05:39:55.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tutal, yung excise taxes lang naman po ang gagalawin ng emergency powers.

asr-004097
05:39:55.580 --> 05:39:57.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kundi, nandyan pa rin po yung vat.

asr-004098
05:39:58.300 --> 05:40:09.660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa presentation nga po ng DOF dito sa ating kapulungan, mao-offset din naman ng pagsususpende ng excise tax yung patuloy na koleksyon ng 12% vat.

asr-004099
05:40:09.860 --> 05:40:16.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil habang tumataas nga yung presyo kada litro, tumataas din po yung vat koleksyon ng ating pamahalaan.

asr-004100
05:40:16.720 --> 05:40:25.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya muli, dapat po may malinong na posisyon ang DOTR, tumindig, kasama po na malawak na transport sector,

asr-004101
05:40:25.920 --> 05:40:33.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lang po drivers, operators, mga companies, lalong-lalong ng mga provincial and city bosses, pati po mga commuters.

asr-004102
05:40:33.720 --> 05:40:37.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang laki po ng epekto sa agrikultura ng taas ng presyo ng langis,

asr-004103
05:40:38.020 --> 05:40:44.700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang laki ng epekto niyan sa presyo din ng pagkain at mga batayang pangangailangan.

asr-004104
05:40:44.700 --> 05:40:54.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya mas maraming bosses na nananawagan na gamitin ng emergency powers para suspendehan ng excise taxes, mas makakatulong po sa taong bayan.

asr-004105
05:40:55.540 --> 05:41:02.080
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, lahat po ng iyong tinuran ay napakalaking bagay po para po sa DOTR.

asr-004106
05:41:02.340 --> 05:41:08.480
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: At asahan niyo po na ito po ay aaraling mabuti ng DOTR para po makatulong kami sa inyong panawagan.

asr-004107
05:41:09.140 --> 05:41:14.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon po, Mr. Speaker, narinig na rin po natin kanina yung tungkol sa fuel subsidies.

asr-004108
05:41:14.700 --> 05:41:23.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi niyo nga po na para po sa 2027, pagkano pong nakalaan muli para dito?

asr-004109
05:41:25.120 --> 05:41:28.280
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Zero po ito sa NEP, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague.

asr-004110
05:41:28.700 --> 05:41:30.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Zero, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004111
05:41:30.720 --> 05:41:36.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa panahon po na wala rin po tayong maaasahan talaga na sapat na mapagkukuna na pondo,

asr-004112
05:41:36.400 --> 05:41:41.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi lang ngayon, kundi sa susunod na taon, ganoon po kahalaga, ganoon po kakritikal yung

asr-004113
05:41:44.700 --> 05:41:52.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: reforme pero yung agalan po na pagbabago sa taxation na may kinalaman sa langis.

asr-004114
05:41:52.760 --> 05:42:00.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa ngayon po, sa ating kapulungan ay marami ng mga panukala para babasura yung excise taxes sa petroleum products.

asr-004115
05:42:00.580 --> 05:42:08.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: A gayon din yung pag-aaral at panawagan na tanggalin yung 12% VAT sa petroleum products,

asr-004116
05:42:08.660 --> 05:42:10.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalong na sa diesel at gasolina.

asr-004117
05:42:10.900 --> 05:42:13.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagsama sa Price Act ng Diesel and Gasoline,

asr-004118
05:42:13.840 --> 05:42:19.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yan po yung ilan lang sa mga nararapat bigyan ng prioridad ng kapulungan na ito.

asr-004119
05:42:20.080 --> 05:42:29.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, nais kong magtanong tungkol sa implementation ng bawal-bastoslo sa PUVs sa ating mga public terminals.

asr-004120
05:42:29.960 --> 05:42:35.900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ayon po sa LTFRB Memorandum Circular No. 2023-016,

asr-004121
05:42:36.220 --> 05:42:42.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: obligado ang PUV operators natiyaking walang anumang gender-based sexual harassment sa loob

asr-004122
05:42:42.520 --> 05:42:43.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kanilang mga sasakit.

asr-004123
05:42:43.840 --> 05:42:52.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ng anumang insidente ay maayos na matugunan, mabigyan po ng aksyon, ma-report sa ating authorities.

asr-004124
05:42:53.940 --> 05:42:59.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa pagpapatupad po ba ng Memorandum Circular na ito, paano ito minomonitor ng LTFRB?

asr-004125
05:43:01.140 --> 05:43:11.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil meron pong malinaw na obligation, halimbawa yung mga PUV operators na matugunan ang mga incidents ng gender-based sexual harassment.

asr-004126
05:43:11.460 --> 05:43:13.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po ba tayong...

asr-004127
05:43:13.840 --> 05:43:16.840
