Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa Foreign Assisted Projects ng Proposed for 2027.

asr-005348
06:30:23.100 --> 06:30:28.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, total of P232.23 billion for 14 projects.

asr-005349
06:30:28.360 --> 06:30:35.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi po natin isa-isahin, pero kasama po dyan yung mga proyekto for,

asr-005350
