asr-005358
06:31:02.460 --> 06:31:08.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, merong appropriation of 1.942 billion proposed.

asr-005359
06:31:08.640 --> 06:31:16.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But I wanted to point out na sa bawat item na ito, meron na pong nakalagay na information on the loan itself.

asr-005360
