Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Diba?

asr-005361
06:31:17.640 --> 06:31:27.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, JICA, tapos loan numbers, P269, PHP278, and PH285.

asr-005362
06:31:27.020 --> 06:31:27.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-005363
06:31:27.960 --> 06:31:30.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun po yung mga, tama po ba?

asr-005364
06:31:30.340 --> 06:31:32.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano yung ibig sabihin nun?

asr-005365
06:31:32.880 --> 06:31:39.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan na yung mga, they refer specifically to the perfected loan agreements.

asr-005366
06:31:39.660 --> 06:31:40.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba ako?

asr-005367
06:31:41.620 --> 06:31:44.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba na yun ang ibig sabihin ng numbers na yun?

asr-005368
06:31:45.720 --> 06:31:47.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Are those the…

asr-005369
06:31:47.340 --> 06:31:48.640
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Tama po, distinguished colleague.

asr-005370
06:31:48.640 --> 06:31:57.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ibig sabihin, ang point ko lang po dito, yung amounts na yan, nakatali very specifically to the source of funding, the loan.

asr-005371
06:31:58.940 --> 06:32:15.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya ang gusto ko i-point out para sa kongreso, mali po, unconstitutional and unlawful yung ginagawa na tatapyasan yung DOTR, Foreign Assisted Project Fund.

asr-005372
06:32:17.320 --> 06:32:25.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, yung fiscal space na libre ay pupunuan naman ng mga congressional insertions.

asr-005373
06:32:27.260 --> 06:32:27.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005374
06:32:27.420 --> 06:32:27.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi yung…

asr-005375
06:32:27.940 --> 06:32:45.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At sa source na yun, hindi naman pwede gamitin to fund any other project, hindi po ba? Unless ginagawa yun. Yung pondo po ba na para sa loan ay nagagamit ba para sa ibang mga proyekto? Nangyayari po ba yun?

asr-005376
06:32:45.440 --> 06:32:55.600
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, kung ano po yung nakalindicate dyan na amount, yan lang po ang pwedeng gamitin.

asr-005377
06:32:57.080 --> 06:33:09.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede po bang gamitin sa iba yung pondo? For example, yung 1.9 billion for the MRT na nakatali sa loan, pwede po bang gamitin yung amount na yun for some other purpose?

asr-005378
06:33:11.060 --> 06:33:12.440
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Dapat MRT 3 lang po.

asr-005379
06:33:12.440 --> 06:33:14.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pwede kasi may mga kontrato.

asr-005380
06:33:15.440 --> 06:33:16.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dapat MRT 3 lang po yan, di ba?

asr-005381
06:33:16.900 --> 06:33:28.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, at pagkaginamit sa iba yung pondo, ay mananagot, dadalhin sa korte, international arbitration or whatever, ang Pilipinas. Tama po?

asr-005382
06:33:29.020 --> 06:33:35.180
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Tama po. In fact, Distinguished Colleague, nakapending po ito sa Supreme Court ngayon, ito pong particular subject po nito.

asr-005383
06:33:35.840 --> 06:33:37.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, yung sa MRT po?

asr-005384
06:33:37.360 --> 06:33:39.240
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Hindi po, yung sa Foreign Assisted.

asr-005385
06:33:39.520 --> 06:33:41.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, yung Foreign Assisted Projects.

asr-005386
06:33:41.240 --> 06:33:41.920
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Unprogrammed.

asr-005387
06:33:41.920 --> 06:33:45.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As part of the unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-005388
06:33:45.440 --> 06:33:47.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na nilagay sa unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-005389
06:33:47.520 --> 06:34:00.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so yun po ang point, no, na actually, kahit paboritong modus in the past na, okay, mag-insert tayo ng mga proyekto, saan ang source of funding?

asr-005390
06:34:01.120 --> 06:34:02.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The OTR, Foreign Assisted.

asr-005391
06:34:03.820 --> 06:34:10.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Eh, ang gusto po natin i-explicitly ilatag dito on the record, ay actually hindi pwede yun.

asr-005392
06:34:11.600 --> 06:34:15.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At so ngayon, in other words, hindi na maaari.

asr-005393
06:34:15.440 --> 06:34:32.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi maaaring gamitin ng Kongreso bilang madaling so-called source of funding for, call it, congressional insertion, institutional amendments, or whatever, hindi po pwede ito, no?

asr-005394
06:34:32.700 --> 06:34:38.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So hopefully, moving forward, ay hindi na natin makikita yung ganong pattern.

asr-005395
06:34:39.260 --> 06:34:43.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Foreign Assisted Projects of the OTR, as well as other agencies.

asr-005396
06:34:43.360 --> 06:34:45.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di lang po DOTR, may mga...

asr-005397
06:34:46.060 --> 06:34:50.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: MMDA meron, DPWH meron din, no?

asr-005398
06:34:50.300 --> 06:34:53.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And even DepEd and others, no?

asr-005399
06:34:54.180 --> 06:34:57.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so yun po yung unang nire-registro natin at concern.

asr-005400
06:34:59.880 --> 06:35:07.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, that is, sabi ko nga, yun yung biggest item sa budget ng DOTR.

asr-005401
06:35:08.780 --> 06:35:13.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 232 billion out of a total proposed budget...

asr-005402
06:35:13.700 --> 06:35:14.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 200, sorry.

asr-005403
