Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama, 232 billion out of a total proposed budget of 251.

asr-005404
06:35:19.340 --> 06:35:27.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now, let me go to perhaps the smallest item of the budget.

asr-005405
